<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="DEU" style="id">Thuhil kikna</book>
  <para style="h">Thuhil kikna</para>
  <para style="toc1">Thuhil kikna</para>
  <para style="toc2">Thuhil kikna</para>
  <para style="mt">Thuhil kikna</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hi thubu sung a thute sia Israel mite Jordan ngun nisuana sang duisung ah a om laitak Moses ii amate tungah a pau kammalte ahi hi. Amate sia Suph khua nai Jordan Kuam sung a langkhat ah Paran khua, a langkhat ah Tophel, Laban, Hazeroth le Dizahab khuate kilaklaw ah om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />(Sinai Mual pan Kadesh Barnea sia Edom mualtung ngam paina lam zui leang ni sawm le ni khat kipai hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Egypt pan a pusua zawk a kum sawmli kum, a tha sawm le khatna a ni khat ni in Topa ii amate tungah son a, a sawl theampo Moses in mipite tungah son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hi thu a son sia Topa in Heshbon khua a uk, Amor Kumpi Sihon, Ashtaroth le Edrei khua teng a uk Bashan Kumpipa Og, a zaw zawkciang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jordan ngun nisuana Moab ngam sungah a om uh sungin Moses in Pathian ii thukhamte le hilciannate sonthiang tu in kipan hi. Ama in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Sinai Mual ah ih om lai, Topa ih Pathian in eite tungah, ‘Hi mual ah khuangei ma om zo nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngiabuk phelin kikhiin vun. Amor mualtung ngam le a kiimkot ngamkuamte theampo — Jordan Kuam, mualtung ngam le a lei niamnate, thangsang ngamkuam le Mediterranean tuipi vaal dongin pai tavun. Canaan ngam le Lebanon Mualte langkhat kalh in Euphrates Ngun lian dong pai tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hi ngam theampo sia Keima Topa in na taanghpupite Abraham, Isaac le Jacob te le a suan a paalte tungah piak tu in ka kamciam ahi hi. Tuasia pai in la tavun’ hong ci hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Moses in mipite tungah, “Sinai Mual ah ih om lai in note kong son zo a, ‘Note lam kong pui tu vaipuak sia kei atu in haksa lei hi. Kei nguak in ka seam zo buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa na Pathian in note van ah aksi za in hong tamsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na taanghpupite ii Pathian Topa in hong kamciam bangin note a tulkhatvei in hong khangsak hen a, hong nuamsasak tahen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahizong kei nguak in no thu kisik ngawlnate thukhen tu in vaipuak lian sia bangbang pua zo thong tu khi ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na nam uh sim pan a pil a ciim, thu he, a son a hawm ngeite pawl khat teal vun a, note hong uk tu in amate ka koi tu hi,’ kong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hi sia sep tu in a pha khat hi, ci in na lung uh kim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahiciang na nam uh pan na tealsa a pil a ciim le a hawm a son ngei lampuite in kong uksak hi. Pawlkhat in mihing tulkhat, pawlkhat in zakhat, pawlkhat in sawmnga le pawlkhat in sawm uk tu in vaipuak ka pia hi. Minamte sung pan a dang lampuite zongh panmun ka pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Tualai in amate tungah, ‘Na mite sung pan thu kisik ngawl na thu hong sonnate pha tak ngaisak vun a, na mite bek ahizong, note sungah a teang nam dangte a kihel zong pha takin thukhen vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thukhenna te ah nguptuam paaituam nei heak vun; akua akua ahizong a vekpi a kibangin khensak vun. Kuama kiita heak vun, banghang ziam cile na thukhenna te sia Pathian kung pan hong pai hi. Thu khat pawpo note atu in a haksa lei le, hong paipui tavun a, keima ka khen tu hi,’ kong ci sa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua hun laitak ma in, na nasep tu dangte theampo atu kong hil siat zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Eite in Topa ih Pathian hong thupiak bangin ih seam hi. Sinai Mual nusia in tua a zai, a lauhuai sennealngam kaantan in Amor ngam mualtung ngam lampi tawn in ih pai hi. Kadesh Barnea ih thet ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Keima in, ‘Tu in ih taanghpupite ii Pathian, Topa ih Pathian ii eite hong piaksa Amor mualtung ngam theng zo nu hi. En vun, zia lai hi. Ama thupiak bangin pai in la vun. Haisaang heak vun, lau heak vun,’ kong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Ahizong note ka kungah hong pai in, ‘Ih mai ah thudawpkute ngamvil in pai masa sak tawng, tua hile amate in ih zui tu lampi phabel le khuapite omzia hong son thei tu hi,’ nong ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Tuasia pha tuak sa ka hikom nam sim pan khat tek mihing sawm le nii ka teal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amate Eshcol Kuam dong mualtung ngam sungah paito in ngam vil uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amate in tualai ah a mu thingnga pawlkhat hong ciapui kik a Topa ih Pathian hong piak ngam sia lei pha mama hi, hong ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Ahizong Topa na Pathian ii thupiak sia na langpan uh a, tua ngam sungah na tum buatu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Note phun teaptuup in khat le khat tung ah: ‘ Topa in eite hong ensan hi. Hi Amor te ii hong thalup thei tu in ama in Amor te khut sungah aap tu in Egypt pan hong paipui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Banghang tua munah pai tu hi ziam? Ih lau hi. Thu dawp a ih paisakte in tua munah a teang mihingte ei sangin hat zaw, saang zaw a, van banin a ki uum khuapite sungah teang hi, ci in hong son hi. Amate in tualai ah mi thatang liante mu hi!’ na kici uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Ahizong keima in, ‘Tua mihingte kiita heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Topa na Pathian in no lam hong pui tu a, Egypt le sennealngam ah a vawt na mu uh bangin, noma atu ngal hong simsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A pa in a tapa a toai bangin, hi ciang dong lam tawntung ah bit takin hong paipuina thu na mu uh hi,’ kong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ahizong hi bangza in kong ci kawm pan note in Topa sia
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />na mai ah pai masa in ngiaphual tu mun hong zonsak tawntung hi napi na muang bualai uh hi. Na pai natu lam hong lak tu in zanin meikhuam sung, sunin meeikhuam sung noma mai ah pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“ Topa sia na phunna uh a zaak ciang thin uukin, kiciam in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />‘Hi khang ngilo sia sung pan note khat zongh, na taanghpupite tung piak tu a ka kamciamsa lei phana ngam na tum buatu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Jephunneh ii tapa Caleb bek tum tu hi. Ama in kei tungah hong thumaan top a, ama le a suan a paalte ama vilsa ngam ka pia tu hi,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Note hangin Topa kei tung zongh ah hong thin uuk a, ama in ‘Moses awng, nang ngawngawn tua ngamsung tum ngawl tu ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ahihang nang hong hu khutdawn pa Nun ii tapa Joshua a thin khensatna a kho natu in hanthawn in. Ama in Canaan ngam a la tu in Israel te lampui tu hi,’ hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />“Tua zawkciang Topa in eite theampo tungah, ‘Moi lei lai ahiciang a pha le a sia a he ngawl lai na tate — ngalte in man tu na ci uh na tate teng, tua ngam ah tum tu hi. Amate tungah tua ngam ka pia tu a, amate in la tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ahizong note heak kikin Aqaba Tuipidok sang lampi tawn in sennealngamsung zuan kik tavun,’ hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />“Note in, ‘Moses awng, kote Topa tungah maw zo khu hi. Ahizong tu in Topa ih Pathian hong thupiak bangin sim tu khu hi,’ ci in nong zo kik uh hi. Tuasia ciang tua mualtung ngam sim zawk tu sia ol tu ngaisunin, mi sim ngalsim tu in na kithoai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“Ahizong Topa in kei tungah ‘Ngal a sim ngawl natu kidawmsak in banghang ziam cile amate ka ompui buatu a, a ngalte in zo tu hi,’ hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Topa hong ci bang kong son hi, ahizong nong nangai bua uh hi. Ama leedo in kiphatsakna taw mualtung ngam sungah na kuan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tuasia ciang tua mualte tungah a teang Amor te in khuaihon bangin note hong uum hi. Amate in note Hormah dong hong del a, Edom mualtung ngam ah hong zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Topa tungah kapin huna na ngen uh a, ahizong ama in hong nangai ngawlin, hong awlmawk ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />“Tuabangin Kadesh ah ngei hialma ih om zawkciang,
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />a khakbel ciang, Topa thupiak bangin heak kikin Aqaba Tuipidok sang lampi tawnin sennealngam ah ih pai a, Edom mual tung ngam ah ngei hialma ih vakthap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tuasia ciang Topa in kei tungah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tua mual teng ah khuangei ma vak zo ih hi ciang, saksang ah paito in, hong sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in a nuai a hilnate note tungah son tu in keima hong sawl a: ‘Na bee dawnte ma ahi Esau ii suan le paalte ngam, Edom mualtung ngam kaantan in na pai tu uh hi. Amate in no hong kiita tu uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />ahizong amate sim tu in kipan heak vun, banghang ziam cile a ngam metre khat zongh kong pia buatu hi. Edom ngam sia Esau ii suan le paalte ka piaksa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate tung pan an le tui lei thei tu nu hi,’ hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“ Topa na Pathian in na sepna theampo ah thupha hong pia a hina thu phawk tavun. Hi zata a zai sennealngam kaantan in na vakkot sung uh theampo ama in hong keam hi. Ama in hi kum sawmli sung tawntung note hong ompui a, na kisap theampo na nga zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Tua zawkciang Elath le Eziongeber khuate pan Tuipi Thi sang paina lampi pan lampial in nisuana saksang Moab ngam sang ih zuan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa in kei tungah, ‘Lot ii suan le paalte ahi Moab mite ngim pia heak vun a, ngal phuangin langpan heak vun. Amate tungah Ar khuapi ka pia zo a, a ngam bangma note kong pia buatu hi,’ hong ci hi,” ci hi. (
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ar khuapi ah Emim a kici mihing thahat thatang lian nam khat teang ngei hi. Amate sia a tha lian nam dang ahi Anakim te bangin a tun uh saang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Anakim te bangma in amate sia Rephaim zongh kici a; ahizong Moab te in amate Emim ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Edom ngam sungah Hor te teang ngei ahihang Esau suan le paalte in amate notkeak in a minam lalcipsak a, tua munah amate teang uh hi. Israel te in Topa ii a piakna ngam pan a ngalte nungsang ciang a nawkeak bangma ahi hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Tuaciang Topa ii eite hong sawl bangin Zered Ngun ih kaantan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hisia hunin Kadesh Barnea ih nusiat zawk kum sawmthum le kum liat pha hi. Topa in thi siat tu hi a ci bangma in tua khang sungah ngalsim thei pasal theampo thi siat zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate a mot siat mateng Topa in langpan top hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Amate a thi siat zawkciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa in eite tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />‘Tuni in Ar lampi tawnin Moab ngam kaantan vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuasia ciang note in Lot ii suan le paalte ahi Ammon te ii ngam nai na theng tu uh hi. Amate ngim pia heak vun, amate tungah ngal zongh phuang heak vun, banghang ziam cile amate ka piaksa ngam bangma note kong pia buatu hi’ hong ci hi,” ci hi. (
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hi ngam sia tualai ah a teang ngei mite ii min vaw in Rephaim ngam zongh kici hi; Ammon te in Zamzummim ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amate sia Anakim te bangin a tun saang hi. Amate tam mama a, a thahat nam ahi hi. Ahizong Topa in amate mon siat a, tua hu in Ammon te in a ngam la in teang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuabang ma in Edom mualtung ngam ah a teang Esau suan le paal ahi Edom te tungah Topa in vawt hi. Ama in Hor te mon a Edom te in a ngam la in tualai ah tuni dongin teang lai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Crete tuikulh mite Mediterranean tuipivaal tengah teang uh hi. Amate in a teang ciil Avvim te mon in thangsang Gaza khuapi dongin a ngam theampo laaksak hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Moab ngam ih kaantan zawkciang Topa in eite tungah, ‘Tu pan kipan Arnon Ngun kaantan vun. Amor mi Heshbon Kumpipa Sihon sia a ngam taw kopin na khut sungah kong pia khawm hi. Ama simin, a ngam lua tu kipan vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuni a kipan mun theampo ah mihingte in note hong kiita tu in ka vawt tu hi. Na min uh a kilaw ciang mihing theampo lau in liing tu uh hi,’ hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Tua zawkciang Kedemoth sennealngam pan Heshbon Kumpipa Sihon tungah a nuai a kilemna thu puakin kamtaite ka paisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />‘Na ngamsung hong kaantansak ta'n. Ka tot uh lampi pan lampial ngawlin paisuak tu khu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka neak tu uh an le tuite a man kong pia tu uh hi. Ka uuk uh sia noma ngam kaantan a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Topa kote Pathian ii hong piak natu ngam ah a tum tu in Jordan Ngun ka kaantan uh dong na ngamsung hong tawn nuam ka hi bek uh hi. Edom ah a teang Esau suan le paalte le Ar ah a teang Moab te in a ngam uh hong kaantansak hi, ka cisak hi.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Ahizong Kumpipa Sihon in a ngam a kaantan tu uh oai ngawl hi. Ama zo zo a, tu laitak ih omna, ama ngam sia ih laak thei natu in Topa na Pathian in ama a thin sahsakin ngal thin neisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Tuasia ciang Topa in kei tungah, ‘En in, Kumpipa Sihon le a ngam sia na mai ah ka cimawsak zo hi; a ngam la in lua in’ hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Sihon sia a mi teng theampo taw Jahaz khua hui ah eite sim tu in hong pai hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />ahizong Topa ih Pathian in ama sia eite khut sungah hong koi a, a tapate le a mi theampo ih that siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua hun laitak ma in khua theampo la in ih lalcipsak a, pasal, numei, patang ih thatlum siat hi. Khat zongh ih khoaikhe bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A nganno teng le a khua teng ih laaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Topa ih Pathian in Arnon kuam mong ah a om Aroer khua pan kipan khua theampo le tua kuam laizang ah a om khuapi, Gilead dong hong zosak hi. A khua uumna luphungte in ei hong nang zo ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ahihang Topa ih Pathian ii pai ngawl a hong sawlna Ammon ngam nai teng, Jabbok Ngunhui teng, mualtung khuate le mun dang khat pawpo ah ih pai bua hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Tua zawkciang saksang Bashan ngam sang ih manaw a, Edrei khua hui ah eite hong sim tu in Og Kumpipa sia a mi theampo taw hong pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahizong Topa in kei tungah, ‘Ama kiita heak in. Ama, a mi teng le a ngam theampo nang kong pia tu hi. Heshbon a uk Amor Kumpipa Sihon tungah na vawt bangin, ama tungah vawt in,’ hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Tuabangin Topa in Kumpipa Og le a mite eite khut sungah hong koi a, eite in amate ih thatlum siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua hun laitak ma in eite in a khua theampo ih la siat a — ih laak ngawl khua khat zongh om ngawl hi. A vekpi khuapi 60 eite in ih la a — Bashan Kumpipa Og ukna, Argob ngam buppi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hi khuate theampo luphung saangte, a kalhna taw a kithua kongpite taw ki uum hi, tuaciang luphung a nei ngawl khuano tam mama zongh om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khua theampo eite in ih susia siat a, Heshbon Kumpipa Sihon ii khuate ih vawt bangin pasal, nupi le patang theampo ih that siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A ngannote le khuate eite in ih laaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Tua hun laitak ma in Jordan Ngun ii nisuana sang ngam Arnon Ngun pan Hermon Mual dong, tua Amor kumpi niite khut tung pan eite in ih la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />(Sidon te in Hermon Mual sia Sirion ci uh a, Amor te in Senir ci uh hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bashan Kumpipa Og ii ngam theampo eite in ih la a: mual zaangtam tungah khuapite, Gilead le Bashan ngamte nisuana sang Salecah le Edrei khuate dong ahi hi,” ci hi. (
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kumpipa Og sia Rephaim kumpi khakbel ahi hi. Ama ii thaankuang, suang taw kivawt sia a kitee ngeina bang a tee ciang, metre 4 sau in metre 2 dedek zai hi. Tuasia sia Ammon te khuapi Rabbah ah kimu thei lai hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Tua ngam eite in ih laak zawkciang Arnon ngun hui ah a om Aroer khua ii saksang ngam le Gilead mualtung ngam khenkhat, a khuate taw in Reuben le Gad namte tungah ka pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A taanglai Gilead ngam le Bashan ngam buppi, Og ukna ngam buppi, Argob ngam theampo Manasseh minam a langte tungah ka pia hi.” (Bashan sia Rephaim te ii ngam kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bashan a kici, Argob ngam buppi sia Geshur le Mascah ngamngi dongin Manasseh nam Jair in la hi. Tua khuanote sia ama min tapsakin minphuak a Jair khuanote kici lai hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Manasseh nam Machir bee le phung tungah Gilead ka pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Gilead khua pan Arnon Ngun dong ngam le lei sia Reuben le Gad namte tungah ka pia hi. Ngunpi laizang sia amate ii thangsang ngamngi hi a, Jabbok Ngun sia a saksang ngamngi hi a, Ammon te ngamngi khen khat zongh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nitumna sangah a ngam sia Jordan Ngun dong hi a, saksang ah Galilee Tuili, tualai pan thangsang ah Tuipi Thi dong, nisuana sang ah Pisgah Mualpeang dong ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Tua hun laitak ma in amate tungah a nuai a kihilnate ka pia hi: ‘ Topa ih Pathian in Jordan nisuana ngam sia na laak tu uh in no hong pia zo hi. Tu in na ngalkapte ngalhiam pia vun a, a dang Israel namte ii a ngam laak a hu tu in tuate ih mai ah Jordan kan in puak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na zite, na tate le na nganno teng — nganno tam na nei uh kong he hi — bek kong piakna khuate ah taang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hi lai ah note atu hong vawtsak bangma in Topa ii amate a piak tu Jordan nitumna sang ngam teng a laak mateng le amate tua munah thinnuam takin Topa in a teensak mateng in na Israel mipuite hu vun. Tuasia zawkciang kong piaksa ngam hi munah nong cia kik thei tu uh hi.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Tuaciang keima in Joshua ka hil a: ‘ Topa na Pathian ii kumpi niite ahi, Sihon le Og tungah a vawtna theampo na mu siat zo hi; tuaciang nangma in sim a na laak tu ngam a neite theampo tung zongh ah ama in tuabang ma in vawt tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amate kiita heak in, banghang ziam cile Topa na Pathian in no atu ngal hong simsak tu hi,’ ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Tua hunlai ma in thintakpi taw thu ka ngen a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />‘Vaanglianpipa Topa awng, na lian le nalamdang na vawt tu te ii kipatna bek nong lak pheang hunlam ka he hi. Nangma sepna sa bangin nalamdang nasiate a seam thei, vantung ah ahizong leitung ah ahizong pathian om ngawl hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Topa awng, Jordan Ngun hong kaantansak ta'n a, a langkhat lei phana, mualtung ngamhoi le Lebanon Mualte hong musak tan’, ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Ahizong no mipite hangin Topa in kei tungah hong thin uuk a, ka thungetna hong ngai ngawl hi. Tua sangin ama in kei tungah, ‘Pha zo hi! hi thu son kik nawn heak in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pisgah Mualdawn ah pai in a saksang le a thangsang, nisuana sang le nitumna sang teng va en ta'n. Na mu teng pha tak en in banghang ziam cile Jordan ngun kaantan ngeingawl tu ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Joshua a pha takin na hil in. Ama tha pia in, a thin khosak in, banghang ziam cile na mu ngam teng a la tu in ama in mipite lampui tu hi,’ hong ci zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Tuabangin eite Bethpeor khua ngalkhat kuam sungah ih taam hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaciang Moses in mipite tungah, “Kong hil thukham theampo zui vun, tua hile na nungta tu uh a, Topa na taanghpupite ii Pathian ii note hong piak tu ngam na la tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka thupiakte bangma belap heak vun a bangma vawk heak vun. Keima kong piaksa, Topa na Pathian uh ii thu piakte zui vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Peor Mual ah Topa nasepte noma mama in na mu uh hi. Ama in tualai ah Baal a bia theampo mon a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />ahizong Topa na Pathian tungah a thumaan note tuni dongin nungta lai nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“ Topa ka Pathian hong sawl bangin thukham theampo note kong hil zo hi. Na sim tu uh le na laak tu uh ngam ah hi thute zui vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thumaan takin zui vun, tua hile hisia in minam dangte tungah, na ciimna uh lak tu hi. Hi thukhamte theampo a zaak uh ciang, amate in, ‘Hi minam liante sia bangza in ciim a thu he zen ziam?’ ci tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Bang zata minam lian hikale Topa ih Pathian ii ih kitaangsap sim hong nai bangin minam dangte in tuabangin a hu tu pathian khat nei tuan ngawl hi. Ama in hong hu tu in ih ko simin hong zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bangzata minam lian hikale kuama in tuni in kong hil thukhamte bangin a maan thukham nei ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na kihuukna in kidawm tavun! Na mit taw na mute na nuntak lai teng mangil peuma heak vun. Na tate le na tute tung na son tu thu khat sia
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sinai mual ah Topa na Pathian ii mai ah noma dingin na om uh ni in hong kison thu hi a, ama in kei tungah, ‘Mipite ka kungah hong khawm tavun. Leitung ah a nuntak laiteng in amate in kei thu hong nit thei natu, a tate tung zongh ah tuabang ma in a hilsawn thei natu in, amate ka son tu te za le ka oai hi,’ ci in hong son thu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Meikhu vom bangin meisate le van ah meikuang lengto te taw a kituam, tua mualpeang ah pai in, na dindan uh khawngte, na tate tungah son tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua mei sung pan Topa in hong paupui ciang, a paunate za a, ahizong ama lim le meal na mu ngawlna thu zongh son tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in note taw thuciamna a vawt sia na kep natu in bang vawt hamtang tu nu ziam ci in hong son hi — tua in suangpheak nii tungah a at Thupiak Sawmte na zui hamtang tu uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na sim tu le na laak tu uh ngam ah na zui tu thukham theampo a hil tu in Topa in kei hong sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Sinai Mual meikuang sung pan Topa ii noma hong paupui lai in, a lim a meal na mu bua uh hi. Tua ahiciang noma phattuam natu in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />bangbang lim khat pawpo — pasal ahibuale numei meal
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />nganhing ahibuale vacim meal,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />awmtaal nganhing ahibuale ngasa meal bang milim vawtna taw na maw heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Note in van ah na mu — ni, tha le aksi te bia tu in hong kitheam thaak ngawl natu uh kidawm tavun. Hite sia Topa na Pathian in midangte theampo tungah a biak tu in pia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahihang note sia Egypt meikhuk linghna sung pan hong suatak mite na hi uh hi. Tuni na dinmun ahi, ama mihing na sua thei natu uh in note hong pusuapui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Note hangin Topa na Pathian sia kei tungah hong thin uuk a, ama ii note hong piak leipha ngam ah a tum tu in Jordan ngun kaantan ngawl tu ni hi ci in hong thiang son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kei hi lai ngam ah thi tu khi hi, ngun kaantan ngeingawl tu khi hi, ahizong note in na kaantan dek tak zo uh a, tua leipha ngam la tu in a pai tu na hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa na Pathian ii note taw thuciam a vawt sia na mangil peuma heak vun. Noma mama in milim nam peuma na vawt ngawl tu in hong thupiak sia zui tavun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />banghang ziam cile Topa na Pathian sia meikuang khat taw kibang a; a dem dangte dual ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Tua ngam ah kum tam mama om in, tu le ta na nei uh ciang zong noma atu in bangbang milim khat pawpo vawtna taw na maw heak vun. Hisia in Topa muna ah a sia hi a, ama thin uuksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka thu nong ni bua uh ahile hi ngam pan a mangthang pal tu na hina thu note langkhat ah ka tetti tu in tuni in vantung le leitung ka ko hi. Ngam na laak natu Jordan ngalkhat ah khuangei na nungta buatu uh hi. Note hong kimon siat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Minam dangte sungah Topa in hong thethaang tu a, no tawm bek na suakta tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Note in tualai ah mihingte khut taw a kivawt pathiante, thing le suang taw a kivawt pathiante, khuamu thei ngawl, khuaza thei ngawl, an ne thei ngawl, a nam za thei ngawl pathiante na na seam tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualai ah Topa na Pathian na zong tu uh a, na thinsung theampo taw na zong uh le na mu tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Note ngim thuak in, tua thute no tung hong tun ciang, a khakbel in Topa kungah na heak kik tu uh a, a thu na ni tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama in hong hesuak thei Pathian ahi hi. Note hong nusia ngawl tu a, hong mon ngawl tu a, na taanghpupite taw a vawt thuciamna mangil ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“A bosa hunte, na sua ma hun le leitung ah Pathian ii mihing a piansakna thute kan kik vun. Leitung buppi ah kan vun. Hi bang na lian khat pawpo nidang in piang ngei na ziam? Hi bang thute akua in za ngei ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Meikuang sung pan pathian ii pauna a zaak zawkciang no bangin, a nungta mihing om ngei na ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Topa na Pathian in Egypt ah note atu hong vawtsak bangin pathian khat pawpo in minam dangte khut sung pan la in ama mi sua ngam ngei na ziam? Ama in note mitmu in a hatna le a vaangletna hong kilanghsak a; natna le ngal thengsakin, nalamdang laknate le a lamdangte vawt a, a lauhuai nate piangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ama bek Pathian hi a, a dang a om ngawlna thu hi nate taw Topa in hong lak vateak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ama in thu hong hil thei natu in vantung pan a aw hong zasak a; hi leitung ah ama ii a thiangtho meikuang hong musak in, tua sia pan hong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Na taanghpupite a it manin note hong teal a, a vaangletna taw Egypt ngam pan hong pusuapui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tu ma zonghin noma neisa ahi, hi ngam sungah hong paipui natu le tua ngam noma hong piak natu in na mainawt kawkawm in ama in note sang a lianzaw le a thahat zaw minamte notkeak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tua ahiciang vantung le leitung ah Topa sia Pathian a hina thu, tuni in phawk vun a, mangil heak vun: Pathian dang om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuni in kong piaksa ama thukhamte theampo zui tavun, tua hile nangma le na suan na paalte theampo na nuamsa tu uh hi. Topa na Pathian ii a tawntung na lua tu in hong piakna ngam ah na teang top tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Moses in Jordan Ngun nisuana sangah khuapi thum koituam a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />tua te sia mihing khat in a ngal a hi ngawl khat a thatlum tha le ngammuangin a suatak thei natu khuapite ahi hi. Hi khuapite khat sungah tai thei tu a, ama kithat ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Reuben nam atu in senneal mual zaangtam tungah Bezer khuapi om a; Gad nam atu in Gilead ngam sungah Ramoth om a; tuaciang Manasseh nam atu in Bashan ngam ah Golan khuapi om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Moses in Pathian thukham le a hilciannate Israel mite tungah pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Hi thukhamte sia Egypt pan a pusua zawk, Bethpeor khua ii langkhat Jordan ngun nisuana sang kuam ah a om lai in pia hi. Tua mun sia Heshbon khua a uk Amor Kumpipa Sihon ii ngam sungah om hi. Egypt pan a pusua zawkciang Moses le Israel mite in ama zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Amate in ama ngam le Jordan ngam nisuana ah a teang Amor kumpi dangkhat ahi Bashan Kumpipa Og ii ngam teng laaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tua ngam sia Arnon Ngun hui ah a om Aroer khua pan saksang Sirion Mual ahi Hermon mual dong kipee hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tuate sungah Jordan Ngun nisuana sang theampo, thangsang pan Tuipi Thi dong, le nisuana sang pan Pisgah Mualpeang dong kihel hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Moses in Israel mite theampo samin amate tungah, “Israel mite awng, tuni in kong piak thukham theampo ngai vun. Sin vun a, pha tak zui vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa ih Pathian in Sinai Mual tungah thuciamna khat vawt a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ih pate bek taw hi ngawlin, tuni in a nungta ei teng taw zong a vawt ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualai mual tungah meikuang sung pan kimaingat in Topa in note hong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua meikuang kiita in mual tungah kaato ngam ngawl na hi uh kom Ama citeng, hong son tu in tua hunin note le Topa kilaklaw ah ka ding hi. “ Topa in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />‘Keima in Topa na Pathian, na saltanna Egypt pan hong suatakpa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“ ‘Keima simngawl pathian dang bia heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“ ‘Vantung ahizong, leitung ahizong leinuai, tui sungah ahizong a om na khat pawpo taw a kibang milim note atu in vawt heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Milim khat pawpo mai ah kun heak vun, ahibuale bia heak vun, banghang ziam cile keima in Topa na Pathian ka hi a, hong demte ka dual bua hi. Kei hong ngaimawte le amate ii a suan a paalte tungah khang thum khang li dongin daan ka pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahizong kei hong it a, ka thukhamte a zuite tungah ka itna khang tul tam mama dongin ka lak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“ ‘Keima min, a sia vawt natu in zangh heak vun, banghang ziam cile keima Topa na Pathian in ka min a zangh khial pawpo daan ka pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“ ‘Keima Topa na Pathian ii kong thupiak bangin Sabbath tang vun a, thiangthosak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Note na na sep natu in ni luk na nei uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />ahizong ni sali ni sia kei atu in a kikoituam tawlngak ni ahi hi. Tua ni in kuama — nangma, na tate, na silate, na ngannote na ngamsung hong teang ngamdangmite in naseam ngawl tu uh hi. Nangma tawlngak bangin na silate zongh tawlnga nanak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Egypt ah sila na hi na le keima Topa na Pathian in ka vaangletna le ka thahatna taw kong suatakna thu ciamtee vun. Tua hu in Sabbath tang tu in thu kong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“ ‘Keima Topa na Pathian ii kong thupiak bangin na nu le na pa zakta vun, tua hile na ma vang tu a, kong piak natu ngam ah khuangei mama na nungta tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“ ‘Mihing that heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“ ‘Palngul mawna vawt heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“ ‘Nguta heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“ ‘A maan ngawlin khat pawpo mawsiat heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“ ‘Midang khat ii zi lungngul heak vun, a inn, a lo, a silate, a khui, a laa, ahibuale a neisa khat pawpo lungngul heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Hite sia mual tungah na kikhop uh lai in Topa ii note theampo tungah hong piak thupiakte ahi hi. Meikuang sung pan le meeisaa te sung panin ama in a vaanglian aw taw hong paupui a, hi thupiakte hong pia in thudang hong son ngawl hi. Tuaciang ama in tua teng suangpheak nii tungah at in, kei tungah hong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Mualtung bup meikuang a khuazing sung pan aw na zaak uh ciang, na lampuite le na nam lutangte kei kungah hong pai in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />‘Meikuang sung pan hong paupuina aw ih zaak ciang Topa ih Pathian in ama ii letna le a minthanna hong lak hi! Pathian in mihing khat paupui zo hi napi ama nungta suak thei lai veve ahi hunlam eite in tuni in ih mu zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahizong banghangin thina tu masuan in om kik tu khu ziam? A lauhuai tua meikuang in hong kaanghlum tu hi. Topa ih Pathian hong paupuina aw ih za kik le ih thi takpi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A nungta Pathian ii meikuang sung pan a paupuina a zaak zawkciang a nungta mihing om ngei na ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Moses awng, pai kik in a, Topa ih Pathian ii ci theampo ngai in. Tua zawkciang hong heak kikin nang tungah hong ci teng ko hong son ta'n. Kote in hong ngai in kong ni tu uh hi,’ nong ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Hi thute Topa in a zaak ciang ama in kei tungah, ‘Hi mihingte pauna ka za a, amate maan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Amate in hi bangin phawk tawntung thong le pha hi! Amate le a suan a paalte, a ma vangin a daupai thei tawntung natu in, keima hong zakta tawntungin ka thupiak theampo hong zui pole pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A buk uh ah a heak kik natu in, pai in va son ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ahizong Moses awng, nang sia keima taw hi lai ah om in a, ka thukhamte le thupiakte theampo kong pia tu hi. Ka piak tu ngam sungah hi thute a zui thei natu in tua teng mipite hil in,’ hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Israel mite awng, Topa na Pathian ii hong thupiak theampo, pha tak zui vun. Ama thukhamte bangma paltan heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Na laak tu ngam sungah na teen suak thei natu le na nopsak tawntung thei natu in tuate theampo zui tavun.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Hi thukham theampo note kong hil tu in Topa na Pathian in thu hong pia hi. Note tumin na laak tu uh ngam sungah tua teng zui tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ngam ah khuangeipi na teen thei natu uh in noma nuntak lai teng noma le na suan na paalte in Topa na Pathian zakta in, kong piak a thukham theampo zui vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel mihingte awng, tuate ngai in zui vun! Tuasia ciang na ma uh vang tu a, ih taanghpupite Topa Pathian ii hong kamciamsa bangin a thahat minam lian na suak tu uh a, tua ngamnuam le lei phana munah na teang tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Israel awng hi thu ciamtee vun! Topa — tuaciang Topa bek — eite Pathian ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa na Pathian sia na thin theampo, na thaa theampo le na thahatna theampo taw it vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuni a kong piak hi thupiakte mangil ngei heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua thupiakte na tate hil vun. Inn ah ahizong, a pua sang na paina ah ahizong, na tawlngak ciang le na nasep ciang ahizong tuate hil kik suut kik vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuate hong phawksak kik tu in na baan ah khit vun a, na talki ah suang vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na innkha khuamte le na kongbiangte tungah at vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“ Topa na Pathian in na taanghpupite ahi Abraham, Isaac le Jacob tungah a kamciam bangin ama in note ii saat ahi ngawl a lian a nuamsa khuapite a om ngam khat note hong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A innte sia noma khol ngawl naphate taw kidim tu a, na taw ngawl uh tuikhukte om in, na ciin ngawl uh sapithuan le olive huante om tu hi. Topa in hi ngam ah hong paipui ciang le na neak nop theampo na nei uh ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />sila in na omna Egypt pan hong suatak Topa mangil peuma heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa na Pathian zatak vawtin ama bek bia tavun a, ama min taw bekin kamciamnate vawt tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A dang pathiante le na kiim na paam ah a teang mite ii pathiante khat pawpo bia heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A dang pathian na bia uh le na tungah Pathian thin uukna meikuang bangin hong theng tu a, hong lalcipsak tu hi, banghang ziam cile note taw a omkhawm Topa na Pathian in a ma a demte dual ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Massah ah na ze et uh bangin Topa na Pathian ze et heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama ii hong piak thukham theampo pha takin zui vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa ii maan hi, pha hi, a ci teng seam vun, tua hile na ma uh vang tu hi. Na taanghpupite tungah Topa ii a kamciamsa ngam phana sia na tang thei tu uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />ama kamciam bangin na ngalte na notkeak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Mailam sangah na tate in, ‘Banghangin Topa ih Pathian in hi thukhamte theampo zui tu in thu hong pia ziam?’ ci in hong dongh tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuasia ciang amate tungah, ‘Eite sia Egypt kumpipa sila ih hi a, Topa in ama ii vaangletna taw hong suatak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama in nalamdang lakna te vawt a, Egypt te le a kumpipa, tuaciang a uliante theampo tungah a lauhuai nate a vawt sia ka mittang taw ka mu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama in ka taanghpupite tungah a kamciam omsa bangin hi ngam hong pia tu le hi lai ah hong paipui tu le hi ngam lua tu in Egypt pan hong suatak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Topa ih Pathian in hi thukham theampo zui tu le ama zatak vawt natu in thu hong pia hi. Tuabangin ka vawt uh le ama in ih ngam hong cing tawntung tu a, hong nuamsasak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pathian ii hong thupiak theampo thumaan takin ih zui le ama eite tungah lungkim tu hi,’ ci in son tavun.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“ Topa na Pathian in na laak tu uh ngam ah hong paipui tu a, ama in tua ngam pan minam tam mama notkeak tu hi. Mainawt in na pai uh kawmin ama in note sang a lianzaw le a thahat zaw minam salite ahi: Hit te, Girgash te, Amor te, Canaan te, Periz te, Hiv te le Jebus te notkeak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa na Pathian in, hi mite na khutnuai ah hong koi a, noma in na zaw uh ciang a vekpi that nanak tu nu hi. Amate taw kipawlna vawt heak vun a, hesuak peuma heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate kuama teenpui heak vun, tuaciang na tate in amate kuama teenpuisak heak vun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />banghang ziam cile tuasia ciang, amate in na tate uh pathian dang a bia tu in, Topa kung pan lam pialpui tu uh hi. Tua bangin a piang le Topa thin uukin thakhat thu noma hong thatlum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuabang ahiciangin amate ii biaknataute baltham vun, a suangkhuam thiangthote saattham vun, a numeipathian Asherah lim zentham in, a milimte haltum vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hi bang vawt vun, banghang ziam cile note Topa na Pathian neisa hi nu hi. Leitung mi theampo sung pan ama aituam mi in note hong teal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Midangte sang na tam zawk uh manin Topa in hong it a, hong teal hi ngawl hi; leitung ah minam citawm belte na hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahizong Topa in note hong it a, na taanghpupite tungah a kamciam taangtungsak nuam hi. Tua ahikom ama in note a thahatna lian taw hong hun a, Egypt kumpipa sila panin hong suaktasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa na Pathian sia Pathian khat bek ahi hunlam le ama ii thumaanna phawk vun. Ama in a thuciam keamcing tu a, ama a itte le a thupiakte a zui mihingte khang tulkhat dongin a itna kip lak tu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />ahizong ama a ngaimaw te daan a piak tu haisaang ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tu ciangin, hong kihilna sate ni tavun a; tuni a kong piak thukham theampo zui tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Hi thupiakte ngai in, thumaan takin na zui uh le, na taanghpupite tungah a kamciam bangin Topa na Pathian in noma taw a thuciamna keam suak tu a, a itna kip hong lak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in hong it in thupha hong pia tu a, pungin ta tam mama na nei tu uh hi; ama in na lote thupha pia tu a, lo ante, sapittui le olive thaute na nei tu uh hi; ama in khuite le tuu tam mama piakna taw thupha hong pia tu hi. Noma hong piak tu in na taanghpupite tungah a kamciamsa ngam le lei ah hi thupha theampo hong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Note bangin thupha tamzaw a saang hi leitung ah kuama om ngawl tu hi. Note na hi uh zong, na ngannote ahizong taciing om ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa in natna theampo pan hong dal tu a, Egypt ah na thuak uh a kiitakhuai natnate khat zongh no tungah hong tungsak ngawl tu a, ahizong na ngalte theampo tungah tuate tungsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa na Pathian ii na khut sungah hong piak minam theampo mon vun, hesuak heak vun. A pathiante bia heak vun, banghang ziam cile thitheina piang tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Hi mite ei sang tamzaw a, ih notkeak zo buatu hi ci heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate kiita heak vun; Topa na Pathian in Egypt kumpipa le a mite tungah a vawt thute phawk vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na mittang taw na mu a kiitakhuai natnate, nalamdang lakna te, a lamdangte le Topa na Pathian ii no hong suataksakna, a vaangletna le a thahatna phawk vun. Egypt te a thalup bangma in ama in tu a na kiitak uh hi mihingte theampo mon tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in amate sungah patauna ngawngawn piangsak tu a, suakta in a buu mihingte zongh mon siat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ahiciang hi mite kiita heak vun. Topa na Pathian sia note taw omkhawm hi; ama sia a lian Pathian hi a, ih kiitak tu pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mainawt in na pai uh kawmin ama in hi minamte tawtawm, tawtawm in notkeak tu hi. Note in thakhat thu in amate theampo na mon thei buatu uh hi, banghang ziam cile tuabang na hi uh le ngamsate hong tam seseam tu a, note atu in lauhuai vaial tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa in na ngalte na khut sungah hong pia tu a, amate a kilalcipsak siat mateng in amate patausak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama in a kumpite na khut sungah hong koi tu hi. Na thatlum tu a, amate kimangil tu hi. Kuama in note hong khaktan zo ngawl tu hi; a vekpi na lalcipsak siat tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A milimte hal vun. Tua milim tungah a om khamh le ngunnte dei heak vun a, noma atu in la heak vun. Na la uh le note atu in thina piang tu hi, banghang ziam cile, milim biaknate Topa in huatsa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hi milimte khat zongh na inn ah ciapui heak vun, na ciapui uh le amate tungah haamsiatna sia ma note tungah tung tu hi. Hi milimte zawngsak in na ensan tu uh hi. banghang ziam cile tuate sia Topa haamsiatna nuai ah om hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Note nungta in pungin na khanto thei natu uh le na taanghpupite tungah piak tu a, Topa kamciamna ngam na nga thei natu uh in tuni in kong piak thukham theampo thumaan takin zui vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A bosa kum sawmli sung Topa na Pathian in sennealngam hong kaantan pui in, hi khual khuala hong hawsak a, hong thupiakte zui nuam ziam, zui nuam ngawl ziam ci in, na thinsung na ngaisutnate he nuamin haksatna hong tunsaknate phawk vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in note hong ngilkialsak a, tua zawkciang noma le taanghpupite neak ngeingawl manna na neak tu in hong pia hi. Hi mihingte in a nuntak natu an bek suang ngawl het tu a, Topa ci theampo suang tu a hina thu hong hil nuamin ama in hi bang hong vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hi kum sawmli sungah na puante siacip ngawl a, na peangte tum ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pa in a tate a hil a tek bangin Topa na Pathian in hong hilin daan hong piak hunlam phawk vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuabang ahiciang Topa hong thupiak bangin vawt vun: a thukhamte bangin nungta vun a, zui vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa na Pathian in leiphana ngam — ngunte le ciktuite, mualtung le leikuam ah a luang leinuai luituite omna ngam;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />zungtaang, mangtaang, sapit, thei, talee, olive le khuaitui te a pianna ngam phana ah hong paipui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualai ah na ngilkial ngeingawl tu a, kisapna na nei ngei buatu uh hi. A suangte sungah thik om a, mualte panin taausan na to thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na du theampo na nei tu uh a, ngampha hong piakna hangin Pathian tungah lungdam na ko tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“ Topa na Pathian na mangil peuma heak vun. Tuni in kong piak a thukham khat zongh khe ngawlin zui vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na du theampo nei a, na teen natu uh innphate na sak uh ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />noma khui le tuu, ngunn le khamh, tuaciang a dang na neisa theampo a khanto ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />kiphasak heak vun a, na saltanna, Egypt pan hong suatak Topa na Pathian mangil peuma heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in note sia a ngu nei ngulte le aikamte omna tua a lauhuai sennealngam zai hong kaantan pui hi. Tui om ngawlna, tua lei kona ngam sungah note atu in suangpi sung pan tui luangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sennealngam sungah na taanghpupite ii a neak ngeingawl uh ahi manna sia na neak tu in hong pia hi. Ama in a khak sangah thupha hong piak thei natu in haksatnate taw hong ze et hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua hi a, noma vaangletna le na thahatna uh taw hau khu hi, ci in ngaisun ngei heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na hau natu in vaangletna hong pia pa sia Topa na Pathian a hina thu phawk vun. Ama in hi bangin hong sep sia na taanghpupite taw a vawt thuciam tungah tuni dongin a thumaan laina hang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa na Pathian mangil heak vun, pathian dangte bia in a na seam heak vun. Tuabang na hi uh le note hong kithatlum nanak tu a hina thu tuni in kidop natu kong hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa thu na ni bua uh le mainawtin na pai uh kawmin tua na mai hong suak minamte a lalcipsak tu bangma in note hong lalcipsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Israel mite awng, ngai vun! Tuni in Jordan Ngun na kaantan tu uh a, note sangin a lian zaw le a thahat zaw minamte neisa ngam le lei na la tu uh hi. Amate ii khuapite lian in, a luphungte van ban hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua mihingte a tun saangin thahat a; a thatang lian a, kuama ii zaw zawk ngawl a ci sia na zaaksa uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahizong tu in Topa na Pathian sia note mama in meikuang bangin na mai ah a pai na mu tu uh hi. Mainawtin na pai uh kawmin, ama hong kamciam bangin, na ngalte na nawkeak tu uh le, manlang takin na mot natu in tua mite hong zawsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“ Topa na Pathian in note atu in amate a nawkeak zawkciang, note ii kilawm manin hi ngam nga tu in hong paipui hi ci heak vun. Note ii kilawm man hi ngawl a, hi mite a siat hu in no atu in Topa in notkeak tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na phatna le a maan na sepna uh hangin Topa in amate ngam hong lasak tu hi ngawl hi. Hi mite seksolna hang le na taanghpupite Abraham, Isaac le Jacob tungah a kamciam a taangtutsak nop manin Topa in amate notkeak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Note ii kilawm manin Topa in hi ngampha hong pia ahi ngawlna thu telthiang vun. Tuabang hi ngawl hi, note sia mihing thinpuite na hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Sennealngam ah Topa na Pathian na thin uuksaknate mangil ngei heak vun. Egypt na nusiat ni a kipan, hi lai na thet uh dong ama langpanin na leedo zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sinai Mual ah zongh Topa a thin na uksak uh a — hong mot siat tu za dongin thin uuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa ii note taw thuciam a vawt sia a ki atna suangpheakte a saang tu in mual tungah ka kaato hi. Tualai ah sun sawmli le zan sawmli ka om a, an le tui ka ne bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaciang Topa in ama ii khut taw ma a at suangpheak niite hong pia a, tuate sia mual tungah na kikhop uh ni in meikuang sung pan hong son thute ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hi hi, sun sawmli le zan sawmli zawkciang thuciam a atna suangpheak niite Topa in keima hong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Tua zawkciang Topa in kei tungah, ‘Mualtung pan thakhatin tuaksuk in, banghang ziam cile Egypt pan na paipui na mihingte lalthaangin, a sia ngamta uh hi. A sep a vawt tu in ka thupiaknate pan amate lampial zo uh a, amate atu in milim khat vawt zo uh hi,’ hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“ Topa in kei tungah, ‘Hi mihingte thin puizia ka he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hong khaam heak in. Kuama ii a phawk nawn ngawl natu in amate lalcipsak tu ka sawm hi. Tuasia ciang amate sangin a lian zaw le a thahat zaw minam khat ii pa kong suaksak tu hi,’ hong ci lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Tua ahiciang thuciam ki atna suangpheakte nii toai in mualtung pan ka tuaksuk hi. Mualtung panin meikuang hong pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa na Pathian ii hong thupiak sia na zui ngawlna uh le leisung sumpiang khat taw khuitalno milim vawtin Topa tungah na mawna uh kong mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ahikom, tua mun note mai ah suangpheakte nii lei denna in ka nei a, tamhthamsak khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua zawkciang khatvei ma ni sawmli le zan sawmli sung, anne ngawl tuidawn ngawlin Topa mai lei ah ka bok kik leleau hi. Tuabang ka hina sia Topa tungah maw in a thin na uuksak uh hang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Note hong lalcipsak tu za dongin a thinso ahikom Topa ii thin uuk mama na sia ka kiita hi; ahizong khatvei ma Topa in ka thu hong ngai kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa sia Aaron tung zongh ah thalup tu za dongin thin uuk ahikom Aaron atu zonghin tua hun laitak ma in thu ka ngetsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Note ii na vawt uh hong mawsak thil — leisung sumpiang taw na vawt uh khuitalno milim — la in mei sung denna ka nei hi. Tuaciang tua milim sia semneen in ka ngoaivui a, a vuite mualtung pan a luang suk lui sungah ka vawk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“ Topa na Pathian sia Taberah, Massah, le Kibroth Hattaavah ah na om lai uh zonghin a thin na uksak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama hong piak tu ngam sia a la tu in thupiaknate taw Kadesh Barnea pan hong paisak lai in, ama na langpan uh a; a thu um ngawlin na ni bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />No kong heak pan kipan Topa na langpan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Ama ii note mot tu a khensat sia he ka hikom, Topa mai ah sun sawmli le zan sawmli sung lei ah ka bok hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuaciang keima in, ‘Vaanglianpipa Topa awng, na thahatna le na vaangletna taw Egypt pan pusua in, na suatak sa na mite mon heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Na naseam Abraham, Isaac le Jacob te phawk in a, hi mihingte ii thin puina, a seksolna le a mawnate awlmawk heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuabang ahi buale amate tungah na kamciam omsa bangin na mite tua ngam ah thetpui zo ngawl hi, Egypt te in hong ci tu hi. Amate na ngaimawk manin na mite thalup tu in sennealngam ah paipui hi, hong ci tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Bangbang po ahitazong, hi mihingte sia nangma atu na tealsa te hi a, na vaangletna le na thahatna taw Egypt pan na pusuapui mihingte ahi hi,’ ci in thu ka ngen hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Tuasia ciang Topa in kei tungah, ‘A masa a te bangma in suangpheak nii vawt in a, a koi natu thingkuang khat vawt in. Keima kung mual tungah hong kaato ta'n a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />na tapsak suangpheakte tungah ka at tengma tua suangpheakte tungah ka at tu a, tua zawkciang tuate thingkuang sungah na koi tu hi,’ hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Tua ahiciang acacia thing taw thingkuang khat ka vawt a, a masa lai a sia taw a kibang suangpheak nii vawt in mual tungah ka paipui to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaciang Topa in tua suangpheakte tungah a masa a at kammalte, mualtung na kikhop uh ni in meikuang sung pan note tungah hong son Thupiak Sawmte at hi. Topa in tua suangpheakte kei hong pia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tuaciang kiheakin mualtung pan ka tuaksuk hi. Tua zawkciang Topa thupiak bangin ka vawtsa thingkuang sungah tuate ka koi a — tua hun pan kipan tualai ah om hi,” ci hi. (
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel te sia Jaakan mite ii tuikhukte pan pai in Moserah zuan uh hi. Tua munah Aaron thi in kivui a, a tapa Eleazar in a thiampi za laih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua mun pan amate Gudgodah ah pai uh a, tua mun pan tui tam omna mun Jotbathah theng uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mual tungah Topa in Thuciamna Thingkuang a cing tu, thiampi na a seam tu, tuaciang ama min suangin thupha a pia tu in Levi namte nasep pia hi. Hi nasepte tu dongin amate nasep hi lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahikom Levi nam in nam dangte nga bangin lo ngam nga ngawl hi; amate ii nga sia Topa na Pathian ii kamciam bangin Topa ii thiampite a hina hamphatna sia ahi hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“A masa lai bangma in mual tungah sun sawmli le zan sawmli ka om hi. Topa in khatvei ka thu hong ngai lai a, note hong mot ngawl tu thukim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuasia ciang ama in na taanghpupite tungah piak tu in a kamciamsa ngam le lei na nga thei natu uh note lampui in a pai tu kei hong sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Tu in Israel mite awng, Topa na Pathian ii note tungah hong nget thute pha tak ngai vun: Topa bia vun a, hong thupiak theampo zui vun. Na thin theampo uh taw ama it in, a na seam tavun a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />a thukham theampo zui vun. Note phattuam natu in tuni in tuate kong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A saangbel vantungte ngawngawn Topa neisa hi a, leitung le a tung a om na theampo zongh ama ii neisa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahizong Topa in na taanghpupite a itna lian mama ahikom midangte taangin note hong teal a, note sia ama tealsa te na hi lai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahiciang tu pan kipan Topa thu ni tavun a, na thinpuisak nawn heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa na Pathian sia pathiante theampo tung le a vaang nei theampo tungah thu neibel hi. Ama lian in thahat a, kiitak tu ahi hi. Ama in nguptuam nei ngawl a, sumnguk saang ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in tangate le meingongte a pha in vawt a, eite sungah a teang ngamdangmite it in, an le puansilhte pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ahikom tua ngamdangmite tungah itna lak vun, banghang ziam cile note khatvei Egypt ngam ah ngamdangmi ma hi ngei nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa na Pathian ii thu ni in ama bek bia vun. Ama tungah thumaan in ama min bek suangin na kamciamna te vawt vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama pok vun — ama na Pathian uh hi a, noma atu a vawt a lian le a lamdang nate na mit mama uh taw mu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na taanghpupite Egypt ngam ah a pai lai in mihing sawmsali bek pha hi. Ahizong tu in Topa na Pathian in note van ah aksi bangza in tam mama hong phasak zo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“ Topa na Pathian it vun, a thukham theampo zui tawntung vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa tung pan na sin sate tungtawnin ama taw kisai na heak thute tuni in phawk vun. Tuabangin a hete sia na tate hi ngawlin, noma na hi uh hi. Topa letna, a vaangletna, a thahatna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />le nalamdang lakna a vawtte mu nu hi. Ama ii Egypt kumpipa tung le a ngamsung theampo ah a nasepna sa te mu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Egypt ngalkapte ii hong del lai in Topa in Egypt ngalkaphonpi sia a siphute le a siphu ngalleangte taw San Tuipi sungah tuitaa in a bo siat sakna thu mu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hi mun na thet uh ma in sennealngam sungah Topa in note atu hong sepsaknate na he uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Reuben nam Eliab ii tapate Dathan le Abiram tungah Topa ii nasepna phawk kik vun. Mihing theampo ii mu in leitang kihong a ama sia a innkuan puite, a puanbukte le a naseamte le a ngannote theampo taw valhtum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hi hi, Topa ii nasep lian theampo a mute noma nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Tuni in kong piak thukham theampo zui vun. Tua hile na tum natu ngam sia ngun kaantan in lua thei tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaciang Topa ii na taanghpupite tung le a suan a paalte tungah piak tu in a ciam ngampha le ngamnuam ah khansau in na nungta tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Noma laak tu ngam sia nidang in na teenna uh Egypt ngam bang hi ngawl hi. Tualai ah thaicii na poai uh ciang lo sungah tui piak natu luam to in haksa takin na na seam uh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />ahizong na tum natu ngam sia mualte le leikuamte omna ngam hi a, nguatui nga na ngam ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa na Pathian in hi ngam keamcing a, kum tawntungin cing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Tua hi a, tuni in kong thupiakte zui vun; Topa na Pathian sia na thin theampo taw it in, a na seam vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuabang na hi uh le, Topa in na ngam sungah a kisap ciangin tuuk ngua, khaal ngua hong zusak tu a, note atu in antang, sapittui le olive thaute,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />le na ngannote atu in lopa om tu hi. Na du an pawpo na nei tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A dang pathiante biakna le a na sepna taw in Topa kung pan noma le noma lam kipialsak heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuabang na hi uh le no tungah Topa thin uuk tu hi. Ama in nguatui hangsak tu a, leiko leih in an piang ngawl tu hi. Tuaciang Topa in note hong piak ngam le lei sia pha napi tua munah na thi pal tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Hi kong thupiakte na thin le na lung sungah ciamtee vun. Na baan ah sawm tavun a, hong phawksak tu in na tal ah suang vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na tate tungah hil vun. Inn ah na om ciang ahizong na va ciang ahizong, na tawlngak ciang le na nasep ciang ahizong na tate sonpui vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na innkha khuamte tung le na kongbiangte tungah at vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Topa na Pathian ii na taanghpupite tungah piak tu in a ciamsa ngam sungah noma le na tate, kum tam mama na nungta tu uh hi. Lei ii tungah van a om lai teng tua munah na teang tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“No kong piaksa thukham theampo thumaan takin zui vun: Topa na Pathian it vun a, a thupiak theampo seamin, ama tungah thumaan vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuasia ciang, mainawt in na pai uh kawmin tua minamte theampo ama in notkeak tu a, note sangin a lianzaw le a hatzaw mite ii leitang na la tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na sina lei theampo note neisa hi tu hi. Na ngam zaina uh sia thangsang sennealngam pan saksang Lebanon mual dong, nisuana sang Eupharates ngun dong, nitumna sang Mediterranean tuipi dong hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ngamsung na paina po ah Topa na Pathian ii hong kamciam bangin ama in, mihingte ii kiitak hong hisak tu uh a, kuama in note hong khaam zo buatu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Tuni in note na teal tu in thupha khat le haamsiatna khat kong pia hi —
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuni in kong piak Topa na Pathian thupiakte na zui uh le thupha khat hi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />ahizong Topa na Pathian thupiakte zui ngawlin na biak ngeingawl pathian dangte na bia uh le haamsiatna khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Na laak tu uh ngam sungah Topa in hong paipui ciang, Gerizim Mual pan thupha na thangsak tu uh a, Ebal Mual pan haamsiatna na thangsak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />(Hi mualte nii sia Jordan Kuam ah a teang Canaan mite ngamsung Jordan ngun ii nitumna sangah om hi. Tua mualte sia nitumna sangah om a, Gilgal khua nai Moreh thingkung thiangthote taw kikhuala ngawl hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Topa na Pathian ii hong piakna ngam a lua tu in Jordan ngun na kaantan tu uh hi. Tua ngam la in na teen uh ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />tuni in kong piak thukhamte theampo pha takin zui vun.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Na pu na pate Pathian, Topa ii note hong piak ngam ah na teen hunsung teng na zui tu uh sia hi thukhamte ahi hi. Tuate na ngai vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na laak tu ngamsung mihingte ii a pathian biakna mun ahi mualsaangte tung, mualnote tung le thingkung hing nuai theampo suksiatsak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A biaknataute baltham vun a, a suangkhuam thiangthote sutham vun. Tua munte ah tuate a kibiak nawn ngawl natu in Asherah numeipathian limte mei taw halin, a milimte semneen vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Hi mihingte ii a pathiante a biak bangin Topa na Pathian bia heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in noma nam teng ii ngamsung pan mun khat teal tu a, tua mun ama ompuina mai ah a mihingte pai in bia tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualai ah na biakpiakna theampo, meihal biakpiakna le a dang sangaw biakpiaknate, sawm a khat le na sumpite, Topa tungah na kamciam letsongte, thinzaw biakpiaknate, le na khui le na tuute sung pan a no suakciilte pia vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua munah note thupha hong pia Topa na Pathian mai ah nangma le na innkuanpuite in an ne in na vawt sa thuphate tungtawnin na lungdam tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Tua hun hong thet ciang na sep ngei uh bangin na seam nawn bua het tu uh hi, tu ciang dong noma lungkim bang pawpo in na bia uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />banghang ziam cile Topa na Pathian ii hong piakna ngam, nuam takin na teen thei natu uh mun na theng bua lai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jordan ngun na kan uh ciang Topa in tua ngam hong ngasak tu a, tualai ah hong teangsak tu hi. Ama in na ngalte theampo khut sung pan hong keamcing tu a, lungmuangin na teang tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in ama a kibiak natu in mun khat tealtuam tu a, kong thupiak bangin tua munah na theampo na puak tu uh hi: tuate in meihal biakpiakna le a dang sangaw biakpiaknate, na sawm a khat le na sumpite le Topa tungah na kamciam a tuam vilvel letsongte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua mun Topa mai ah na tate, na naseamte le na khuate sungah a teang Levi te taw lungnuam khawm tavun; Levi te in lo ngam a nei ngawl natu thu phawk tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na tealna mun pawpo ah sangaw biakpiakna na pia buatu uh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa in noma nam khat ii ngam sungah mun khat teal tu a, tua mun bek ah na pia tu uh hi. Tua mun bek ah meihal biakpiakna na pia tu uh a, ka thupiak bangin a dangte theampo na vawt siat tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Ahizong na teenna mun po ah na ngannote ngoin, na ne thei tu uh hi. Topa hong piak zaza na ne thei tu uh hi. Na vekpi in biakna taw kisai a thiangte zongh, a thiang ngawlte zongh in sangai sa le sathak sa na neak uh bangin ne thei nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahizong a chi na ne bua het tu uh a; tuasia lei ah tui sun bangin na sung tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na teenna munte ah Topa tungah na piak uh nate na ne buatu uh hi: tuate in sawm a khat in na piak antang, sapittui, olive thau, na khui le na tuu a no suakciilte, Topa tungah na kamciam letsongte, thinzaw biakpiaknate, ahibuale a dang biakpiaknate ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nang le na tate in na naseamte le na khuate sungah a teang Levi te taw Topa na Pathian ii tealsa biakna mun, Topa na Pathian ompuina mun bek ah hi biakpiaknate nekhawm tu nu hi. Na nasepna sa theampo hu in tua munah na lungdam tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na ngam sungah na teen uh laiteng Levi te zongh na ngaingon peuma heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Ama kamciamsa bangin, Topa na Pathian in na ngam hong keaksak ciang, na du hun pawpo ciang sa na ne thei tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua biakna mun sia a khuala lei ahile, kong cisa bangin Topa hong piaksa khui ahibuale tuute khat pawpo na uuk hun po ngoin inn ah a sa na ne thei tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sangai sa le sathak sa a neak uh bangin biakna taw kisai a thiang khat zongh, a thiang ngawl khat zongh in tua sa ne thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A sungah chi om lai sate ne heak vun; banghang ziam cile chi sungah nuntakna om a, nuntakna sia sa taw nekhawm peuma heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chi sia an in nei heak vun, tui bangin lei ah sung zaw vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hi thupiak na zui uh le Topa lungkim tu a, nangma le na suan na paalte theampo na ma uh vang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na biakpiaknate le Topa na kamciamsa letsongte biakna munah paipui vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Topa biaknatau tungah a kihaltum tu in sangaw biakpiaknate tua munah pia vun. A sa na neak tu uh sangaw biakpiakna zongh biaknatau tungah pia vun a, biaknatau tungah a chi sung vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />No tungah kong thupiak theampo thumaan takin zui vun, tua hile nangma le na suan na paalte a tawntungin na ma uh vang tu hi, banghang ziam cile noma in a maan nate le Topa na Pathian a lungkimsak nate a seam tu na hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“A ngam na sim uh ciang Topa na Pathian in hi minamte mon tu a, a ngam la in na teang tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Topa in tua minamte a mot zawkciang a biakna vawtziate na zui ngawl natu uh in kidawm vun, banghang ziam cile tua in thina bona hi tu hi. Amate biak bangin na biak thei natu in a pathian te, a biakna vawtzia te kan sese heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Amate ii a pathiante a biakzia bangin Topa na Pathian bia heak vun, banghang ziam cile a pathiante a biak uh ciangin Topa ii ngaimawk, a kiihuai nate theampo vawt uh hi. Amate in a tate ngawngawn pia in a biaknataute tungah mei taw hallum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Kong thupiak theampo zui siat vun; khat zongh belap heak vun a khat zongh vawk heak vun.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Kamsaang khat ahibuale mang khia thei khat in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />nidang in na biak ngeingawl pathiante a bia tu le a naseam tu in hong zolna in nalamdang lakna khat ahibuale a lamdang na khat hong kamciam thei tu hi. Ama hong kamciamte tak suakin a maan hial zong,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ama awlmawk heak vun. Topa sia na thin theampo taw na it takpi ziam ci in hong heak nop manin, Topa na Pathian in tua pa zangh in hong ze et ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa zui in zatak vawt vun; a thu ni in a thupiakte zui vun. Ama bia in, a tungah thumaan vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahizong na saltanna Egypt pan hong suatak Topa langpan tu in hong sawl mangkhia theite ahibuale kamsaangte peuma thatlum vun. Tua bang mite sia misia hi a, noma nuntak natu a Topa ii hong thupiak nuntakna sia pan hong pialpui nuam hi. Hi siatna taw na kipeal natu in amate thalup kul tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Na suapui, na tapa, na tanu, na it na zi, na lawm phabel te ngawngawn in noma le na taanghpupite ii na biak ngeingawl uh pathian dangte bia tu in hong hanthawn ku thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate khat pawpo in na nai a teang mite ii pathiante ahibuale a khualana ah a teang mite pathiante bia tu in hong hanthawn thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahizong ama in zolsak heak vun a; a thu zongh ngai heak vun. Khuangaihuai sa in hesuak heak vun a, amate sungsia heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate that vun! Suang taw a deang masabel hi vun a, tua zawkciang midangte theampo zongh in deangsak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate suang taw deanglum vun! Na saltanna Egypt pan hong suatak Topa na Pathian kung pan lam hong pialpui nuam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua hile Israel mite theampo in thupiang teng za tu a; lau tu uh hi, tuaciang kuama in hi bang a sia ngamta kik nawn ngawl tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“ Topa na Pathian hong piak khuate sungah na teen uh ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />a masa na biak ngeingawl uh pathiante a bia tu in na minam sung pan mihing ngina ngawl pawlkhat in amate khua puite a lampui khialna thu na za thei tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuabang kamleang na za uh le a maan le a maan ngawl kantel vun a; hi bang thu pha ngawl piang takpi ahile,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tua khua mite theampo le a ngannote theampo zongh thatlum siat vun. Tua khua lalcipsak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua munah a teang mihingte ii neisa theampo khawmtua in khua laizang khawlmun ah seng vun. Topa na Pathian tungah biakpiakna in tua khua le a sungah a om teng hal siat vun. A tawntungin tua khua sia a lal in kinusia tu a, khua kisaat kik ngei nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A kisusia nate sung pan note atu in na khat zongh la heak vun, tuasia ciang Topa thin uukna thai in hong hesuak tu hi. Tuni in kong piak ama thupiakte theampo zui in, a deina bang na seam uh le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />na taanghpupite tungah a kamciamsa bangin note hong hesuak in, note hong pungsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Note sia Topa na Pathian ii mite na hi uh hi. Tua hi a, mithi na kaa uh ciang midangte ii vawt bangin, na pumpi noma le noma ki at heak vun a, na mai samte meet heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa na Pathian neisa na hi uh a; leitung ah a teang mihing theampo sung pan ama mi tu in hong tealsa na hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“ Topa ii thiang ngawl hi a ci peuma ne heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hi nganhingte ne thei tu nu hi: tuate sia khui, tuu, keal,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />sangai, ngamtuu, ngamkeal le sathak —
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />a peangcin kaa in eakkha zongh a thai nganhing pawpo ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahizong a peangcin kaa ngawl le eakkha zongh a thai ngawl nganhingte na ne buatu uh hi. Kalaoh, bilpi le ngalhvang te ii sa ne heak vun. Tuate sia eakkha thai ahihang a peangcin kaa ngawl ahikom a thiang ngawlin kingaisun tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Voksa ne heak vun. Amate peangcin kaa hikale eakkha thai ngawl ahikom a thiang ngawlin kingaisun hi. Hi nganhingte peuma ne heak vun a, a thisate ngawngawn tham heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Ngasate sung pan a hawlip le a tha neite na ne thei tu uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />ahizong tui sungah a nungta hawlip le tha a nei ngawlte peuma ne heak vun; Tuate sia a thiang ngawlin kingaisun tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“A thiang vacimte ne thei tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahizong a nuai a vacimte ne ngawl tu nu hi: tuate sia muvanlai, simbu, muthi, mupui, mumeikaa, musan, va-ak, kalaoh vacim, tuipiva, hilniang vacimlian, vakaang, tuingumpai, ngun va, vasuangui le bak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Tha a nei lungno theampo thiang ngawl hi; ne heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lungno a thiang pawpo ne thei tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Ama thu in a thi thawthong nganhing sa ne heak vun. Note sungah a teang ngamdangmite in nesak thei tu nu hi, ahibuale ngamdangmite tungah zuak thei tu nu hi. Ahizong note sia Topa na Pathian neisa na hi uh a; ama mite na hi uh hi. “Tuuno sa ahibuale kealno sa sia a pui noaitui sungah huan heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Kum simin na lo pan an a piang theampo ii khen sawm sua khen khat — sawm a khat a tuamin koi vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Topa na Pathian ii ama biak natu in a tealna munah paipui vun. Tua mun ama mai ah sawm a khat na piak uh antang, sapittui le olive thau, tuaciang tuu le keal no suakciilte ne vun. Topa na Pathian a tawntung na zatak thei natu in tuabangin hi vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Topa thupha piak hangin a piang sawm a khat te puak natu in tua biakna mun khat sia na inn pan a khuala lei le, hi bangin vawt vun:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ante zuakin, a sum teng biakna munah paipui vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na du pawpo — khuisa, tuusa, sapittui, beer lei in tua mun Topa na Pathian mai ah nangma le na innkuanpuite in nuam takin ne in dawn vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Na khuate sungah a teang Levi te en thong heak vun; amate tuamin neisa bangma nei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kum thum cin simin na piak uh sawm a khat an teng hong paipui in na khua sung uh ah khol vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hi an sia neisa bangma a nei ngawl Levi te atu le, na khua sungah a teang ngamdangmite, tangate, le meingongte atu ahi hi. Amate hong pai in a kisap bangin la tu hi. Tuabangin vawt vun, tua hile na Topa Pathian in na nasep theampo thupha hong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Kum sali a cin simin note tungah sum hong kiba theampo maisak tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hi bangin vawt tu ahi hi. Israel a mipui khat pawpo tungah sum a puk sia in a sumpuk teng maisak tu hi; leiba siik nawn ngawl tu hi; banghang ziam cile Topa in tua leiba kimaisak zo hi, ci in thangsak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngamdangmite ii hong batte na siik thei tu uh a, ahizong na mipuite ii hong batte siik ngawl het tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“ Topa na Pathian ii hong piakna ngam ah ama in thupha hong pia tu hi. Tuni in kong thupiakte theampo pha takin zui in, ama thu na ni uh le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />no mipite sung pan khat zongh zawngkhal ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hong kamciamsa bangin Topa in nang thupha hong pia tu hi. Minam tam mama te tungah sum na pukthaak tu uh a, ahizong kuama tung pan sum na pu buatu hi. Minam tam mama na uk tu uh a, ahizong kuama in no hong uk buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“ Topa na Pathian ii hong piakna ngamsung khua khat pawpo ah kisapna a nei Israel na mipui khat po a om le, haza heak vun a, na hu thada heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua sangin a taangsap za ngo takin sum puk vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Leiba maisak kum nai ahitazong sumpuk nuam ngawlin om heak vun. Tuabang khua ngaisutna siate na thinsung uh ah tumsak heak vun. Sum na puk nuam bua uh le amate in note hong langpanin Topa tungah ko tu a, tuaciang no a maw na suak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama tungah haza ngawlin deisakna taw pia vun, tua hile na nasepna theampo ah Topa in thupha hong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel te sungah a zawng le a cimaw pawlkhat om tawntung tu ahiciang, tuate tungah ngo takin na piak natu uh in thu kong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Na mipui Israel te, pa ahibuale numei khat sia sila in na tungah ama le ama hong kizuak le, kum luk sung na hong sepsak zawkciang na tha tu hi. A kum sali ciang ama na suaktasak nanak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na inn pan na suataksak ciang khut hawm nguakin pusuaksak heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa ii thupha hong piakte sung pan — tuute, antangte, le sapittui te ngo takin ama tungah pia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Noma Egypt ngam ah sal na tanna uh le Topa na Pathian ii hong suataksakna thu phawk vun; tua ahi hu in hi thupiakna tu in kong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Ahizong na silapa in hong nusia nuam ngawl tha tu hi; nangma le na innkuanpuite it in hong om suak nuam tha tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuasia ciang, na innkha ah paipui in a, tua munah a bil vut in; tuaciang a nuntak sung tawntung na sila hi tu hi. Na sila numeite zongh tuabang ma in vawt vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na sila khat na suataksak ciang na thinnasak heak vun; a tatakin ci leang a kicial naseam khat ii thaman lang taw ama in kum luk sung na hong sepsak zo hi. Hi bangin vawt vun, tua hile, Topa na Pathian in na nasepna theampo ah thupha hong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“ Topa na Pathian atu in na khui le na tuu sung pan a tal a suakciilte theampo tuam koi vun; hi khuite khat zongh naseam in zangh heak vun a, tuute khat zongh a mul meet heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kum simin Topa ompuina ahi tua biakna mun khat sia ah nangma le na innkuanpuite in tuate ne tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahizong tua ngannote sitbaanna khat pawpo, a peangbai, a mittaw, mealhemna a nasia khat pawpo a nei le tuate Topa na Pathian tungah sangaw biakpiakna in zangh ngawl het tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuabang ngannote na inn ah ne thei tu nu hi. Note theampo biakna taw kisai in na thiang uh zong na thiang bua uh zongin sangaisa le sathaksa na neak uh bangin tuate ne tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahizong a chi ne heak vun; tui sun bangin lei ah sung zaw vun.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abib tha sungah Paisan Poai vawtna taw in “ Topa na Pathian patoai vun; tua tha sung zan khatin ama in Egypt pan note hong suatak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Biakna mun khat sia ah pai vun a, tua munah Topa na Pathian patoai natu in Paisan poai an in na tuu ahibuale na khui khat ngo vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hi an na neak uh ciang tol kisaw anluum ne heak vun. Egypt pan hi bingbungin, na pusua uh lai na neak uh bangin ni sali sung tol saw ngawl anluum na ne tu uh hi. Thuakna mun ahi Egypt ngam pan na pusua ni uh sia na nuntak lai teng na phawk thei natu in hi anluum ne vun — tuasia thuakna anluum kici tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na ngam sungah kuama in a inn ah ni sali sung tol koi ngawl tu hi; a ni masabel ni, nitak a na ngaw uh nganno ii sa sia tua zan ma in ne siat tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Paisan Poai sung a kizangh ngannote sia Topa na Pathian ii hong piak tu ngamsung mun khat po ah ngo ngawlin — biakna mun khat sia bek ah ngo vun. Egypt na nusiat hun, nitum hunin ngo vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A sa huanin tua biakna munah ne vun a; a zingsang ciang inn ah cia vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua zawk ni luk sung tol saw ngawl anluum na ne tu uh a, tuaciang ni sali ni in Topa na Pathian bia tu in kikhawm vun a, tua ni in naseam heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Anlaak na kipat hun pan kipan nipi sali sim vun a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa na Pathian patoai natu in ama hong piak thupha taw kizui in thinzaw biakpiakna paipui in Anlaak Poai vawt vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa mai ah na tate, na naseamte le Levi te, ngamdangmite, tangate le noma khua ah a teang meingongte taw lungnuam khawm vun. Biakna mun khat sia ah lungdam takin biakna vawt vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Egypt ah na saltannate uh mangil heak vun a; hi thupiakte pha takin zui vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Taang na cil siat zawkciang le sapittui na suuk siat zawkciang ni sali sung Buk Poai khaam vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na tate, na naseamte, Levi te, ngamdangmite, tangate le na khua sungah a teang meingongte taw lungdam in poai vawt khawm vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Biakna mun khat sia ah ni sali sung hi poai vawtin, Topa na Pathian patoai vun. Topa in na lo an le na nasepna ah thupha hong piak hu in lungdam vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Na minam sung pan pa theampo in kum khat sung thumvei tua biakna munah Topa bia tu in pai tu hi: tuate sia Paisan Poai, Anlaak Poai, le Buk Poai te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa na Pathian ii hong piak thuphate taw kizui in, amate kitunna zaza taw mi simin letsong khat tek keng tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“ Topa na Pathian ii hong piak thukhente le ulian dangte khua sim ah koi vun. Hi mite in thu lang khen ngawl, nguptuam nei ngawlin mipite tungah thukhen tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate in a thukhenna ah thumaan ngawlin khen ngawl tu a, nguptuam nei ngawl tu hi; amate in sumnguk la ngawl tu hi, banghang ziam cile letsong te in mipilte le a thumaante ii mit ngawngawn tawsak in, a maan ngawlin thu khensatsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa na Pathian ii hong piak tu ngam lua a, tualai ah na teen tawntung thei natu in, thutang in thumaan tawntung vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“ Topa na Pathian atu in biaknatau na vawt ciang, a kungah thing taw a kivawt Asherah numeipathian lim khat koi heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaciang milim biak natu in suangkhuam khat pawpo na phut heak vun; Topa in tuate ngaimaw hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“ Topa na Pathian sia mealhemna khat pawpo a nei khui ahibuale tuu taw bia heak vun; Topa in tuasia ngaimaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Sonteena in na khuate uh khat sungah pa ahibuale numei khat sia pathian dangte ahibuale ni, tha, aksite a biakna taw
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa tungah maw in a thuciamna palsat in, Topa thupiak a langpan ahi hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tuabang thu na za uh le, pha takin kantel vun. Hi bang thusiate Israel te sungah a piang takpi le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tua pa khua pua sangah paipui in suang taw deanglum vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahizong tetti nii ahibuale a tamzaw in ama khial hi ci in tetti a pang le bekma tua pa kithatlum thei tu a; tetti khat bek a om le ama kithatlum ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tetti te in ama suang taw deang masa tu a, tuaciang a taang lai mite in deang tu hi; hi siatnate hi bangin bosak tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Khua sung thukhente atu in khensat haksa ahi, neisa kituuna, pumpi kiliamsuana, mihing thalupna le mihing thisakna a khentel tu thute hong om tu hi. Hi bang thute a om ciang Topa na Pathian ii tealsa biakna mun khat sia ah pai in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tua thu sia Levi mi thiampite le tua laitak a seam thukhenmangte mai ah puak vun a, amate in khensatsak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in thu khensatna nei tu a, amate hong son bang linlian in noma seam tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A thu khensatna saang vun a, a son bangin a khawng a kheakin zui vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Vaipuak nei thukhenpa ahibuale thiampipa thu ni ngawlin a ta ngam pawpo sia kithatlum tu hi; tuabangin Israel te sung pan hi bang thusiate nilkeak tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuasia ciang hi thu a za theampo lau tu uh a, kuama dang tuabangin ngamta ngam nawn ngawl tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“ Topa na Pathian ii hong piak tu ngam la in, na teen zawk uh ciang na kiim na paam a om minamte theampo bangma in kumpi khat kisamh sa in nei tu na khensat tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kumpi tu in na teal uh sia Topa ii a tealsa mi hi hamtang sak vun. Ama sia na mipui khat hi nak tu a; ngamdangmi khat, na kumpi in koi heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kumpipa in ama ngalkaphonpi atu in siphu tampi nei thei ngawl tu hi, siphu lei tu in Egypt ah mite sawl ngawl tu hi, banghang ziam cile Topa in a mite tualai ah heak kik ngeingawl tu hi, ci in a sonsa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kumpipa in zi tam nei ngawl tu hi, banghang ziam cile hisia in ama Topa kung pan lampialsak tu hi; tuaciang ama le ama khamh le ngunn taw hau heak hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kumpi a sua ciang ama in Levi mi thiampite ii kep thubu ciil sia pan la in a kikhum kik Pathian thukhamte le hilciannate a ki at thubu khat nei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua laibu sungah thupiak theampo thumaan takin a zui natu le Topa zatakna zia a heak thei natu in, ama kungah tua thubu koi in a khan tawntungin sim tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuabang a hina taw a Israel mipuite sangin ama phazaw tuan kisa ngawlin Topa thupiakna te a zui ngawl natu khaamsak tu hi. Tuasia ciang ama kum tampi mang tu a, a suan a paalte in Israel ngam, khang tam mama uk tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Israel ngam sungah thiampi nam ahi Levi te in leitang tel khat zongh nga ngawl tu hi; tuasia taangin amate sia Topa tungah a kipia sumpite le a dang biakpiaknate taw nungta tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nam dangte nei bangin amate in leitang nei ngawl tu hi; Topa kamciamsa bangin amate tel sia Topa ii thiampite a hina sia ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Khui ahibuale tuu taw biakpiakna a kivawt simin thiampite tungah a liang, a kha le a ngilpi kipia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thiampite in a masabel a kila anpal, sapittui, olive thau le tuumul te nga tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in noma nam theampo sung pan Levi nam sia ama atu thiampi a seam tawntung tu in teal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Levi te ahi khat pawpo Israel ngam khua khat po pan biakna mun khat sia ah a pai nuam sia tua munah seam thei tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tualai ah na a seam Levi dangte bangma in, Topa a Pathian ii thiampi na seam thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in thiampi dangte ii an nga za ma nga tu a, tuaciang a innkuanpuite ii a thaak pawpo keam thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“ Topa na Pathian ii hong piak tu ngamsung na tum uh ciang, tualai ah a om minamte ii a kiihuai ngamtatnate zui heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Biaknataute tung mei sungah na tate biakpiakna in pia heak vun; na mite in aisaanna, dei ai, bum
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />le phuisamnate zanghsak heak vun a, mithisa ii thaate thu donghsak heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hi bangin a kiihuai na a zangh mite Topa na Pathian in huatsa a, tua hu in mailam na manaw uh ciang tua ngamsung pan tuabang minamte hawlkeak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa tungah thumaan tatak vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Moses in, “Na laak tu ngam ah mite in aisaan theite le ai toaite thu ngai in a nungzui uh hi, ahizong Topa na Pathian in tuabangte na vawt tu uh hong oai ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuate taangin ama in kei taw a kibang kamsaang khat na mite sung pan no hong puak tu a, ama thu na ni tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Sinai Mual ah note na kikhop ni in Topa hong paupuina aw na zaak kik ngawl natu, ahibuale ama ompuina meikuang na mu nawn ngawl natu in ngen nu hi, banghang ziam cile na thi tu uh lau nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Topa in kei tungah, ‘Amate ngetna maan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate mi sung pan nang taw a kibang kamsaang khat amate ka puak tu hi; a ci tu thute ka son tu a, ka thupiak theampo mipite tungah sonsawn tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama in ka min suangin thuson tu a, ama thu a nial peuma daan ka pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahizong kamsaang khat pawpo in ka thupiak ngawl thu khat ka min suangin a son ngam le ama thi tu a, pathian dangte min suangin a son kamsaang khat pawpo zongh a thi kul tu hi,’ hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Kamsaang pa ii thuson sia Topa tung pan hong pai ahile ahi ngawl na lungman hun uh om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kamsaang khat in Topa min taw thuson a, tua thu hong taangtung buale Topa ii kammal hi ngawl hi. Tua kamsaang pa sia ama uk thu in thuson hi a, ama kiitak tu hi ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“ Topa na Pathian ii hong piak tu ngam sungah a teang mihingte Topa na Pathian in a mot siat zawkciang le a khuapite le a innte la in, tua munah na teen zawk uh ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tua ngam sia khen thum in khen vun a, a khen simin ol takin a kihaw thei khuapi khat tek nei tu hi. Tuasia hun ciang mihing khat in ngual khat po a thalup ciang, a buk natu in tua khuapite khat pawpo zuan thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mihing khat in a ngal ahi ngawl khat a thatlum tha ahile, tua khuapite khat pawpo zuanin suakta tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sonteena in, mihing nii duisung ah thingtom tu in kuankhawm a, khat pa ii thing a siik laitak a heitang zuukin a lawmpa sia a khalum tha le ama tua khuapi thumte khat sungah tai in suakta tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bukna khuapi khat bek om thong hile a tai natu khuala leih tu ahiciang, a phulam nuam a mealheak pa in mawnei ngawl a innpaam pa pha tu a, thin uuk tutna in thatlum tha tu hi. Tua hi a, ama in a ngal pa ahi ngawl mihing khat thatlum tha ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahikom bukna khuapi thum koi tu in thu kong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“ Topa na Pathian in na taanghpupite tung a sonsa bangin na ngam uh keak vaial in, ama kamciamsa ngam theampo no hong piak ciangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />khuapi thum na teal thua tu uh hi. (Tuni in kong thupiak theampo vawt a, Topa na Pathian it in, hong hil bangin na nungta uh le ama in hi ngam note hong pia tu hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A maw ngawlte in thina a thuak ngawl natu le, Topa ii hong piak tu ngam sungah a thi uh hu in mawsiatna a thuak ngawl natu in hi bangin seam vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Ahizong sonteena in, mihing khat in a ngal pa thatlum lui a, tua zawkciang a suakta tu in khuapi thumte khat zuan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuabang thu a om ciangin ama khua lampuite in tua pa a kithalup thei natu in, ama samsak tu a, a thalup pa ii mealheakte tungah phulam in a thalup tu in aap tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama hesuak heak vun. Israel te sung pan mihing that pa bosak vun, tua hile na ma uh vang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“ Topa na Pathian ii hong piak tu ngam sungah nidang lai pekin a kiphut, na innpaam na lopaam te ii ngisuang khiin heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Khialna lian a vawt khat mawsak natu in tetti khat bek taw kicing ngawl a; mihing khat maw piak natu sia a tawmbel in tetti nii kisamh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mihing khat in midang khat a natsak nopna hangin thumaan ngawl taw maw a suan le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />a nii in biakna mun khat sia ah pai tu a, tua laitak vaipuak nei thiampite le thukhente in a thu khensak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thukhente in tua thu a pha takin kantel tu a; a Israel mipuipa sia thumaan ngawl taw a mawsak thawthong ahile,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />mawsiat a thuak pa ii a thuak tu daan sia ama in thuak tu hi. Tuabangin thumaan ngawl ngitlona bosak tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuasia ciang a kuama po in tua thupiang za tu a, lau in, kuama in tuabang a sia vawt kik ngeingawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hi bang thute ah hesuakna lak heak vun a; daan piak natu sia nuntakna khat luangin nuntakna khat, mittang khat luangin mittang khat, hatang khat luangin hatang khat, khut khat luangin khut khat, peang khat luangin peang khat hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Na ngalte sim tu in na kuan uh ciang, ngalleangte, siphute le ngalkaphonpi khat sia note neiza sangin a tamzaw in na mu uh ciang tuate kiita heak vun. Egypt pan hong suatak Topa na Pathian sia note taw hong omkhawm tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngalsim tu na kipat ma in, thiampi khat sia mai sangah hong pai tu a, ngalkaphonpi tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />‘Israel mite awng ngai vun! Tuni in ngal simin na kuan tu uh hi. Na ngalte kiita heak vun a, lau in liing heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa na Pathian in note hong tonpui tu a, zawna hong pia tu hi,’ ci tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Tuasia ciang ngalkap bute in a mite tungah, ‘Hi sungah inn thak a sak zawk bek hi a, aapna a vawt ngawl lai khat pawpo a om ziam? A om le a inn ah cia kik tahen. Tua hi ngawlin ngal sungah ama a kithat le a inn sia mi dang khat pawpo in aapna vawt tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hi sungah sapithuan thak a vawt zawk bek hi a, ahizong sapitnga a lo ngawl lai khat pawpo a om ziam? A om le a inn ah cia kik tahen. Tua hi ngawlin ngal sungah ama a kithat le mi dang khat pawpo in tua sapittui taw nuamsa tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hi sungah zi nei tu in mo dongh sa khat pawpo a om ziam? A om le a inn ah cia kik tahen. Tua hi ngawlin ngal sungah ama a kithatlum le midang khat pawpo in a dok sa numei sia teenpui tu hi,’ ci tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Tuaciang ngalkap bute in a mite tungah, ‘Hi sungah patau in a lauthauh khat pawpo a om ziam? A om le, a inn ah cia kik tahen. Tua ahi buale ama in a dangte thin lalsak tu hi,’ ci si tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngalkap bute in ngalkaphonpi tungah a thuson a man zawkciang a pawl sim atu in lampuite kiteal tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Khuapi khat sim tu in a pai uh ciang a masa phit belin tua khua mite na khutnuai ah hong tum thei natu in hun pia vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in kongpite hong honin hong ki aap ahile, a vekpi in na sila suak tu a, na na hong sepsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahizong tua khua mite hong ki aap nuam ngawlin do tu hong sawm zaw le tua khuapi na ngalkaphonpite taw uumci vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa na Pathian in tua khuapi zawna hong piak ciang a sung a om pa theampo thatlum siat vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahizong noma atu in numeite, patangte, ngannote, le khua sung a om nadang theampo la thei tu nu hi. Na ngalte neisa theampo zangh thei tu nu hi. Topa in note tungah hong pia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Note teen natu ngam pan a khualana khuapite tungah tu a bangin vawt tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Ahizong Topa na Pathian ii hong piak ngam sungah a om khuapite na laak uh ciang, mihing theampo thatlum siat vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa ii hong thupiakna bangin a mihing theampo, Hit te, Amor te, Canaan te, Periz te, Hiv te le Jebus te mon vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A pathiante a biak ciang a kiihuai nate sep tu hong hil na taw, Topa tungah a maw na sua ngawl natu in amate thatlum siat vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Khuapi khat na laak nop uh ciang khuangei mama sung na kiim uum ta uh zong a thingnga kungte phuktan heak vun. A thingnga ne vun a, ahihang a kungte lalsak heak vun; a kungte sia na ngalte uh hi ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thingkung dangte na phuk thei tu uh a, khuapi a kilaak mateng in kulh uumna in zangh thei tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Sonteena in, Topa na Pathian ii hong piak natu ngamsung lo khat ah mihing khat kithatlum a, a that sia he ngawl nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na lampuite le thukhente pai in mithi luang a kimu na mun pan a naina khua teng khat sim taw a kikhualatna tee tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaciang mithi luang a kimu na pan a naibel khua sia ii lampuite in na a kiseamsak ngeingawl lai khuila khat teal tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in tua khui sia tui a kang ngeingawl luihui, a kitho ngeingawl, an a kiciing ngeingawlna munah paipui tu a, tua munah a ngawng meaktan tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Levi suan thiampite zongh tua munah pai tu hi, banghang ziam cile ngongtatna huvau thuneina theampo amate in thukhen tu uh hi. Topa na Pathian in ama naseam tu le ama min suangin thuphate a pia tu in amate teal zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua zawkciang a mithi luang a kimuna mun taw a kinaibel khua lampuite theampo in khuila tungah a khut sil tu uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tuaciang, ‘Hisia pa ka that bua uh a, a that sia ka he bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa awng, Egypt pan na suatak Israel, na mite maisak in. A maw ngawl mihing khat a kithalupna hangin maw hong pusak heak in a, hong maisak ta'n,’ ci tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuasia ciang, Topa ci bangin na vawtna uh taw mihing thalupna huvau hong kimawsak ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“ Topa na Pathian in ngalzawna hong pia in ngalte na mat uh ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />amate sungah dik na sak le na teenpui nop numei mealpha khat mu thei tu ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua nu na inn ah ciapui ta'n a, ama in na inn ah a sam meetin a khutcinte tan tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />a puante laih tu hi. Tua nu sia na inn sungah a nu le a pa ngai in tha khat sung hee in om tu hi; tua zawkciang teenpui tu ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hun khat ciang ama na dei nawn buale ama suaktasak tu ni hi. Zawthawk thu taw ama ompui zo na hi ciang sal bangin na vawt thei buatu a, na zuak thei buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Sonteena in pa khat in zi nii nei a, a zite in tapa veve neipui hi, ahizong a tapaciil sia dik a sak zawk a zi taw a ta hi ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua pa in a tate tungah a neisate hawmsak tu a khensat ciang hamphat tuam nei heak hen, a tapaciil ii nga tu tel sia ama diksak zawk a zi taw a nei tapa tungah pia heak hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama ii diksak zawk a zi ii tapa hi ngawl ahihang a tapaciil tungah ama ii neisa sung pan tel a see nii in pia tu hi. Pasal khat in a tapaciil sia a thusim kul a, tapaciil ahi hu in a nga tu tel sia a piak kul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Sonteena in mihing khat in a thinpui, ngual a langpan vilvel tapa khat nei in, daan a piak hang a nu a pa thu ni ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A nu le a pa in a tapa sia a teenna khua lampuite mai ah thusit thuak tu in paipui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amate in lampuite tungah, ‘Ka ta uh sia thinpui in hong langpan a, thu ni nuam ngawl hi; ama in dangka pakvawt in zu ne hi,’ ci in son tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuasia ciang khua mite in tua pa suang taw deanglum tu a, tuabangin hi siatna bosak tu nu hi. Israel ngam sungah mihingte theampo in tua thupiang za in lau tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Mihing khat ama ii khialna hangin kithat in a luang sia khuam tungah a kikhai le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />tualai ah zan ngiaksak heak vun. Tua a luang sia tua ni ma in kiphum tu hi, banghang ziam cile khuam tungah a kikhai mithi luang khat in tua leitang tungah Pathian haamsiatna tungsak hi. Topa na Pathian ii hong piak ngam le lei na nitsak ngawl natu in a luang phum vun.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Na Israel mipui khat ii khui ahibuale tuu sia suakta in a tai laitak na mu le en thong heak in a; a nei pa kungah paipui kik in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahizong a neipa a teenna khuala a, a neipa na he buale na inn ah ciapui in. A neipa hong pai in hong kat ciang pia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na Israel mipui ii a laa, a puan ahibuale a bosua na khat pawpo na mu uh le tuabang ma in vawt vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Israel na mipui khat ii laa ahibuale a khui a puk le en thong heak in a; a neipa na huna in phongto kik in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Numeite in pate puan silh ngawl tu a, pate in numeite puan silh ngawl tu hi; Topa na Pathian in tuabang a silhte ngaimaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Thingkung tung ahibuale lei ah vacim bu khat nangma in mu luilam in, a pui sia a tuuite op a, ahibuale a note uapin a om le a pui laaksak heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vacim note ahile la thei ni hi, ahihang nuamsa in na khansau natu in a pui tha nanak tu ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Innthak na sak uh ciang na innkhum kiil kiimkot ah taangban zawl thungin uum hamtang vun. Tua hile mihing khat taakin a thi hial zong mawsiat thuak ngawl tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Lo khat sungah sapit le thaicii dang khat pawpo ciingkhawm heak vun; na ciingkhawm uh le sapit ahizong, an piang dangte ahizong ne thei ngawl tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Khuital khat le laa khat a kaap in lotho khawmsak heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Samul le puanneal a kitak khawm puan silh heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Na puan king li ah zepna teapkaaite koi vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Sonteena in mihing khat in numei khat teenpui a, hun khat ciang dei nawn ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahiciang, a maw natu zongin a kiteen lai in ngaknu thiangtho hi ngawl hi, ci in mawsiat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Hi bang thu a piang le tua nu ii nu le pa in ngaknu thiangtho a hina a heaksak natu in, a kiteen ni zan a, a delpha chi baang puan sia thukhenzum ah a lak tu in khua sung lampuite kungah paipui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua numei ii pa in amate tungah, ‘Ka tanu sia hisia pa taw ka teangsak a, ahizong tu in dei nawn ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in ka tanu sia a maan ngawlin mawsiat a, a kiteen lai in ngaknu thiangtho hi ngawl hi, ci hi. Ahizong ka tanu ngaknu thiangtho khat a hina sia hi sungah tetti om hi; a kiteen lai a delpha chibaang puan sia en vun!’ ci tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaciang khua lampuite in a pasal samin saat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate in ngunntang zakhat zongh liausak tu a, tua sumte numei ii pa tungah pia tu hi, banghang ziam cile tua pa in Israel numei khat mindaisak ahi hu hi. Tua bek dom ngawlin tua nu sia ama zi ma hi suak tu a, tua pa in ama nuntak laiteng tua nu khul thei ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Ahizong a mawsakna thu sia maanin, ngaknu thiangtho a hina thu tetti a lak thei buale,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />a pa inn kongbiang ah ama kipaipui tu a, tua khua pasalte in suang taw deanglum tu hi. A pasal nei ma a pa inn ah a om lai in numei le pa khialna taw ih mipuite sungah a maizumhuai vawt zo hi. Tuabangin hi siatnate bosak tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Mihing khat sia midang khat ii zi taw a khial laitak a kiman le, amate ngeal kithat tu hi. Hi bangin hi siatna bosak tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Sonteena in khua sungah mihing khat sia a kidongh sa numei khat a khialpui zawkciang kiman hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amate ngeal khua pua sangah paipui in deanglum tu nu hi. Tua nu sia khua sungah a om hi a, midangte zaak thei tu in hu ngenin au thei tu hi napi a au ngawl hu in thina thuak tu ahi hi. Tua pa ahile a kidongh sa numei taw a khial hu in a thi kul hi. Hi bangin hi siatna bosak tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Sonteena in, midang khat in a kidongh sa numei khat daaipaam duisung ah buan hi, tuabang ciang tua pa bek kithatlum tu a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />tua numei sia bangma kilaw ngawl tu hi, banghang ziam cile thisak natu za in mawna vawt ngawl hi. Hi thu sia mihing khat in midang khat ngalvawtin a thalup thu taw ma kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua pa in a kidongh sa numei khat daaipaam duisung ah buanin, tua nu in ngalko in au napi a hun tu kuama om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Sonteena in mihing khat in a kidongh ngawl lai numei khat buanin a khialpui laitakin kiman hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua pa in tua numei ii pa tungah mo man in ngunntang sawmnga pia tu a, tua nu sia ama zi suak tu hi, banghang ziam cile tua pa in zawthawk thu taw a khialpui hang ahi hi. Tua pa in ama nuntak sung teng tua nu khul thei ngeingawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Kuama in a pa ii zite khat pawpo taw khialin a pa maimawl sak heak hen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Cil kingetsate ahibuale zang a ki attansate peuma Topa ii mite sungah kihel thei ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Lamlakta ahibuale tuate ii a suan a paal pawpo a khang sawmna dong keak ahizong kuama peuma Topa ii mite sungah kihel thei ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Ammon te ahibuale Moab te — ahibuale amate ii suan le paalte khat pawpo a khang sawmna dong keak ahizong — Topa ii mite sungah kihel thei ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in Egypt pan na pusua uh lai in lampi ah an le tui hong pia nuam ngawl a, note hong haamsiat tu in Mesopotamia ngam Pethor khuapi pan Beor tapa Balaam cial uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahizong Topa na Pathian in Balaam thu ngai ngawl a; note hong it hu in a haamsiatna sia thupha suaksak zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Minam khat na hi uh laiteng, hi minamte hu natu ahibuale a nopsak thei natu bangma seam ngei heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Edom te zawngsak heak vun; na beete uh hi. Tuaciang Egypt te zawngsak heak vun; amate ngam ah teang ngei nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A khang thumna pan kipan a suan a paalte Topa ii mite sungah kihel thei tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Ngalsim hun sung ngiaphual ah na om uh ciang, biakna taw kisai a thiangtho ngawl hong suaksak tu peuma pial vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pasal khat zan a mut lanin a bawtui tee in a thiang ngawl a suak le, ama ngiaphual pua sangah pusuakin tualai ah om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A nitak sangin ama kibual tu a, nitum ciang ngiaphual sungah tum thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Ngiaphual pua sangah awnghaw nop ciang pai thei natu mun khat na nei tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lei taw natu thingbaak khat keng vun a, na awnghaw zawkciang lei huk kik vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na ngiaphual sia biakna taw kisai in thiangsak vun, banghang ziam cile hong keam tu le na ngalte hong zosak tu in Topa na Pathian sia na ngiaphual sungah note hong ompui hi. Topa ii hong nungngat natu za dongin a deihuai ngawl bangma vawt heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Sila khat sia a topa kung pan tai in nang hong beal le puak kik heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate ii tealna khua khat pawpo ah teang thei tu a, vawtsia ngawl tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Israel mi, pa ahizong numei ahizong biakinn ah pumpi zuak khat suak thei ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hi bangin a thalaw sumte zongh kiciamna taangtutsakna in Topa na Pathian inn sungah kipaipui thei ngawl tu hi. Topa in biakinn ah pumpi kizuakte ensan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Dangka, an, ahibuale na khat pawpo Israel na mipuite tungah na pukthaak uh ciang a meet la heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ngamdangmite tungah na pukthaak uh ciang a meet na la thei tu uh a, ahizong Israel na mipuite tungah na pukthaak uh ciang a meet la heak vun. Hi ngeina zui vun, tua hile na laak tu uh ngam sungah na sep na vawt theampo Topa na Pathian in thupha hong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“ Topa na Pathian tungah kiciamna na vawt uh ciang na kamciam sia peal heak vun; Topa in na kamciamna len tu a, na len bua uh le mawna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa tungah kiciamna vawt ngawl sia mawna hi ngawl hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />ahizong thin zawna taw na vawt le len nanak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Midang khat ii sapithuan sungah lampi na tot ciang, sapitnga na du zaza na ne thei tu a, ahizong na bawm sungah heangin bangma ciapui ngawl het tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Midang khat ii lo sungah lampi na tot ciang na khut taw na deiza taanghuite sik in ne thei tu nu hi, ahizong phiau taw taanghui bangma attan heak vun.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Sonteena in pa khat in numei khat teenpui a, hun khat ciang dei nawn ngawl hi, banghang ziam cile tua numei tungah ama diksak ngawl thu khat mu hi. Tua ahiciang ama in kikhulna lai vawt a, tua nu pia in a inn pan ciasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaciang sonteena in tua nu in pasal dang nei kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua pa in zongh dei ngawlin kikhulna lai vawt a, ama pia in, a inn pan ciasak hi. Tua ahibuale, sonteena in a pasal niina thi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hi bang thute tungtaang ah a pasal masa in ama teenpui kik ngawl tu hi; tua pa atu in a numei sia a thiang ngawl ahi hi. Tua pa in a teenpui kik ahile Topa a do suak tu hi. Topa na Pathian ii hong piak tu ngam ah hi bang a cizathuai mawna vawt ngawl tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Zi nei tuung khat sia ngalkap kitumsak ngawl tu a, taangpi nasep khat pawpo zongh kiseamsak ngawl tu hi; a inn ah om in, a zi a lungdamsak thei natu in ama sia kum khat sung na kiseamsak ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Mihing khat tungah na khat na zawn le, khapna in, a zak lai an ngoaina suangte na laaksak buatu hi. Tua in amate innkuan ii nuntak natu in a anneak vawtna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Israel a mipui khat ngu a, sal in a khoai pawpo ahibuale sal in a zuak pawpo kithatlum tu hi. Tuabangin hi siatnate na bosak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“A lauhuai mama vun natna na vei uh ciang, Levi thiampite ii hong son bang linlian in vawt vun; amate tungah ka thupiakte zui vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Egypt pan nong pai uh lai, Topa na Pathian ii Miriam tungah a vawtnate phawk vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Ngual tungah na khat na zawn le khapna in hong piak tu a puansilh sia a inn sungah tumin la heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A puasang pan ngak vun a, ama in piasak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama sia mizawng khat ahile, tuasia zan taamsak ngawlin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />a mut thei natu in nitak simin ama pia kik vun. Tuasia ciang ama lungdam tu a, Topa na Pathian sia na tungah hong lungkim tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Israel na mipuite ahibuale na khua sungah a teang ngamdang mite, zawngin a cimaw na cial uh naseamte theam heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ni sim nitum ma in a nitha pia vun. Ama sum kisamh in, a nga nanak tu sia muang nginge hi. Na pia bua uh le ama in Topa tungah hong khia tu a, noma a maw na hi tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“A tate khialna liante hangin a nu le a pa thina thuak ngawl tu a, a nu le a pa ii khialna liante hangin a tate thina thuak ngawl tu hi; Mihing khat sia ama ii khialna lian a vawt hang bekin thina thuak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Ngamdangmite le tangate ii a nga tu te khaktan heak vun a; meingong nu ii puansilh sia leiba khapna in la heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Egypt ngam ah sal na hina uh le Topa na Pathian ii hong suataksakna thu phawk vun; tua hu in hi thupiakna sia kong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Lo ante na laak uh ciang na laak sa na puak ngawl uhte pai in la kik heak vun; Topa na Pathian in na nasepna po ah, thupha hong piak natu in, tuate ngamdangmite, tangate le meingong nupite atu in kinusiat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Olive kungte khatvei na law zawk uh ciang a taanglaite pai in lo kik heak vun; tuate ngamdangmite, tangate le meingong nupite atu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na sapitngate khatvei na law zawk uh ciang, sapithuan ah a nii veina lun kik heak vun; tua sapit a taanglaite ngamdangmite, tangate le meingong nupite atu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Egypt ngam ah sila na hina uh mangil ngei heak vun; tua hu in hi thupiakna sia kong pia hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Sonteena in Israel te nii sia thu kinei in zum kithen a, thu a khen ciang khat sia maw ngawlin a dang khat sia maw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A maw pa sia saat thuak tu in thu a kikhen le, thukhenpa in ama, lei ah boksakin saatsak tu hi. Bang tanvei saat tu cisia ama khialna lian a vawtna bang hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama sia sawmlivei dong kisaat thei tu a, ahizong tuaza sangin tamzaw ngawl tu hi; tuaza sangin a tamzaw le mipite mai ah maizum a pia suak tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Khuital khat an na cilsak laitakin a muk tuamsak heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Unau nii inn khat ah teang khawm a, khat sia tapa nei ngawlin a thi le, a zi sia innkuan dangah pasal nei thei ngawl tu hi; mithi pa ii suapuipa in ama a teenpui tu sia a vaipuak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mithi pa ii bee le ngui Israel minam sungah a bo ngawl natu in amate ii nei a tapaciil sia mithipa ii tapa in kingaisun tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahizong mithi pa ii suapuipa in ama a teenpui nuam buale tua nu sia khua lampuite mai ah pai tu a, ‘Ka pasal suapuipa in a vaipuak seam ngawl hi. Ama in Israel mite sungah a suapuipa atu in suan le paal pia nuam ngawl hi,’ ci in son tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaciang khua lampuite in tua pa samin thu sonpui tu hi. Tua pa in a teenpui nuam bualai ahile,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />a suapuipa zi in khua lampuite mai, ama kungah pai in tua pa ii peangdap langkhat suutsak in, a maitang cilphii in, ‘A suapuipa atu in suan le paal a pia nuam ngawl sia tungah hi bangin kivawt hi,’ ci tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel sungah tua pa ii innkuan sia, ‘A peangdap a kisuusak pa ii innkuan,’ kici tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Pasal nii kihau a, a khat sia pa ii zi in a pasal hun nuamin, a khat sia pa ii cil le zang a zapsak ahile,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tua nu hesuak ngawlin; a khut tansak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Toaisuangte le piciangte na zak uh ciang theam heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa na Pathian ii hong piak tu ngam ah na khan a sau thei natu in toaisuangte le piciangte thumaan thutak taw zangh vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa in ngualtheamte ngaimaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Egypt ngam pan nong pai uh lai in, Amalek te ii hong vawtnate phawk vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate in Pathian kiita ngawl ahiciang noma toi in na tha uh a bo ciang na nung pan hong simin, nungsangah a toi a baa theampo hong thatlum siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ahikom, Topa na Pathian in ngam hong pia in, na kiim ah a teang na ngalte kung pan ngalmuanna hong piak ciang Amalek te theampo thatlum siat vun, tua hile kuama in amate phawk nawn ngawl tu hi. Tuasia mangil heak vun!
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“ Topa na Pathian hong piak tu ngam la in na teen zawk uh ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />note khat simin na laak maksak uh na lo anpalte sung pan khen khat tek khum khat sungah koi in, biakna mun khat sia ah paipui tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua hun lai in, vaipuak a nei thiampipa kungah pai in, ‘Ka taanghpupite tungah ko hong piak tu a kamciamsa ngam ah ka tum zo uh hi, ci in Topa ka Pathian tungah tu in ka kona uh ahi hi,’ ci vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Thiampipa in nangma tung pan tua khum hong saang tu a, Topa na Pathian biaknatau mai ah koi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaciang Topa mai ah hi kammal teng a lot in son in: ‘Ka taanghpupi sia a vak kawkoai Aram mi hi a, a innkuanpuite Egypt ngam ah teang tu in a paipui pa hi. Amate tualai ah a pai lai in mihing tawm bek hi a, ahizong amate tam pha in a thahat minam suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Egypt te in kote hong vawtsia in zawthawk thu taw sal nasep hong seamsak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuasia ciang ka taanghpupite ii Pathian, Topa tungah hu ngenin ka au uh hi. Ama in hong za a, kote thuakna, haksatna le buainate hong mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in a vaangletna le a thahatna taw Egypt ngam pan hong suatak hi. Ama in nalamdang lakna te le a lamdangte vawtin a kiitakhuai nate piangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in hi munah hong paipui a, khuinoai le khuaitui a luanna hi ngampha le ngamnuam hong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahiciang tu in ama hong piaksa anpalte Topa kungah kong paipui hi,’ na ci tu hi. “Tuaciang Topa mai ah na khum nga suk vun a, tualai ah na bia vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa na Pathian in nang le na innkuanpuite hong piak naphate hangin lungdamko vun; Levi te le note sungah hong teang ngamdangmite zongh taw lungdamko khawm vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Kum thum simin na lo ante — sawm a khat sumpite — sia Levi te, ngamdangmite, tangate le meingong nupite tungah pia vun, tua hile mipite omna theampo ah amate neak tu a kisap za tek nei tu uh hi. Tuabang na vawt zawk uh ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa tungah, ‘A thiangtho sawm a khat sumpite ka inn ah bangma taang ngawl hi; nong thupiak bangin Levi te, ngamdangmite, tangate le meingongte tungah ka pia zo hi. Sawm a khat sumpi tungtaang ah na thupiakte khat zongh ka nial bua a ka mangil bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hee in kaikut a ka om ciang zong, sumpi peuma ka ne bua hi; biakna taw kisai in a thiang ngawl ka hi hun ciang zong, bangma ka inn pan ka pusua bua hi; mithi an siana in ka zangh bua hi. Topa awng na thu hong ni khi hi; sawm a khat sumpi taw kisai nong thupiak theampo ka vawt siat zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Vantung na omna thiangtho mun pan hong ensuk ta'n a, Israel na mite thupha hong pia ta'n; ka taanghpupite tungah na kamciam bangin nong piaksa ngamnuam le ngampha zongh thupha hong piaksak ta'n,’ ci vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Tuni in Topa na Pathian in ama ii thukham theampo zui tu in no tungah thu hong pia hi; tua ahiciang tuate na thin na lung theampo taw thumaan takin zui vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuni in Topa sia note Pathian in na saang zo uh hi, a thu ni a, ama ngeinate theampo zui tu le a thupiak theampo seam tu in kamciam na pia zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama hong kamciam bangin tuni in Topa in note sia ama mihing in hong saang zo a; ama thukham theampo zui tu in thu hong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama ii piansak minam dang theampo sangin a lianzaw in note hong vawt tu a, ama min pokin na patoai tu uh hi. Ama kamciam bangin note ama mihing na hi tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaciang Moses in Israel lampuite taw kopin mipite tungah, “Tuni a kong piak kihilna theampo zui vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jordan ngun kaantan in Topa na Pathian ii hong piakna ngamsung na tum uh ni in, suang lian pawlkhat phut in, buan taw zut vun a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tuate tungah hi thukhamte le hilnate theampo at vun. Na taanghpupite ii Pathian, Topa ii hong kamciamna ahi ngamnuam le ngampha sungah na tum uh ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />le Jordan ngun langkhat na thet uh ciang tuni in kong hil bangin Ebal Mual tungah hi suangte phut vun a, buan taw zut vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua munah thik hiamh taw a kitan ngawl suang taw a kivawt biaknatau khat ciang vun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />banghang ziam cile Topa na Pathian atu in na cian biaknatau peuma a ki attan ngawl suangte taw bekin kivawt tu hi. Tualai ah meihal biakpiaknate na pia tu uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />sangaw biakpiakna pia in pawlkhop biakpiaknate ne in Topa na Pathian mai ah lungdamko vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Buan taw a kizut suangte tungah Pathian ii thukham kammal theampo a kician in at vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaciang Moses in Levi thiampite taw Israel mite theampo tungah, “Israel mite awng, pha tak hong nadon tavun. Tuni in Topa na Pathian ii mi na suak zo uh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tua ahiciang tuni in kong piak ama thukham theampo zui in keamcing tavun,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaciang Moses in Israel mite tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Jordan ngun na kaan zawk in, mipite tungah thupha a kipiak ciang a nuai a minamte sia Gerizim Mual tungah ding tu uh hi: tuate sia Simeon, Levi, Judah, Issachar, Joseph le Benjamin namte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A kihaamsiat ciang a nuai a minamte Ebal mual tungah ding tu uh hi; tuate sia, Reuben, Gad, Asher, Zebulun, Dan le Naphtali namte ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Levi te in hi kammalte nging takin pau tu hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“ ‘Suang, thing ahibuale leisung sumpiangte taw milim vawt a, tuasia a bia ku pawpo tungah Pathian haamsiatna tung tahen; Topa in milim biakna ngaimaw hi.’ “Tuasia ciang mipi theampo in ‘Amen!’ ci in zo tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“ ‘A pa ahibuale a nu a zatak vawt ngawl pawpo tungah Pathian haamsiatna tung tahen.’ “Tuasia ciang mipi theampo in, ‘Amen!’ ci in zo tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“ ‘A innpaam khat ii ngisuang a khiin pawpo tungah Pathian haamsiatna tung tahen.’ “Tuasia ciang mipi theampo in, ‘Amen!’ ci in zo tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“ ‘Mittaw khat a lamlak khial pawpo tungah Pathian haamsiatna tung tahen.’ “Tuasia ciang mipi theampo in, ‘Amen!’ ci in zo tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“ ‘Ngamdangmite, tangate le meingong nupite ii nga tute a khaktan pawpo tungah Pathian haamsiatna tung tahen.’ “Tuasia ciang mipi theampo in, ‘Amen!’ ci in zo tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“ ‘A pa zite khat pawpo khialpuina taw a pa a maimawlsak pawpo tungah Pathian haamsiatna tung tahen.’ “Tuasia ciang mipi theampo in ‘Amen!’ ci in zo tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“ ‘Nganhing taw a khial pawpo tungah Pathian haamsiatna tung tahen.’ “Tuasia ciang mipi theampo in, ‘Amen!’ ci in zo tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“ ‘A suapuinu ahibuale a suapui sealhnu a khialpui pawpo tungah Pathian haamsiatna tung tahen.’ “Tuasia ciang mipi theampo in, ‘Amen!’ ci in zo tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“ ‘A sunghnu a khialpui pawpo tungah Pathian haamsiatna tung tahen.’ “Tuasia ciang mipi theampo in, ‘Amen!’ ci in zo tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“ ‘Mihing a that ku pawpo tungah Pathian haamsiatna tung tahen.’ “Tuasia ciang mipi theampo in, ‘Amen!’ ci in zo tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“ ‘Mawnei ngawl mihing khat thatlum tu in sumnguk a saang pawpo tungah Pathian haamsiatna tung tahen.’ “Tuasia ciang mi theampo in, ‘Amen!’ ci in zo tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“ ‘Pathian thukham theampo le hong hilna teng a zui ngawl pawpo tungah Pathian haamsiatna tung tahen.’ “Tuasia ciang mipi theampo in, ‘Amen!’ ci in zo tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Tuni a kong piak Topa na Pathian thupiak theampo thumaan takin zui in, a thu na ni uh le ama in leitung minam dangte sangin a lian zaw in note hong siam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa na Pathian thu ni vun, tua hile hi thupha theampo noma aa hi tu hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“ Topa in na khua te na lote thupha hong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“ Topa in ta tam, an tam mama, le khui le tuu tam mama taw note thupha hong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“ Topa in na lo ante le tuate sung pan na vawt uh ante thupha hong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“ Topa in na sep na vawt theampo thupha hong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Na ngalte in note hong sim ciang Topa in amate zo tu hi. Amate in mun khat pan hong sim tu a, ahizong no kung pan mun theampo ah taikeak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“ Topa na Pathian in na nasepna uh thupha hong pia tu a, na ansaalte antang taw hong dimh tu hi. Ama ii hong piak na ngamsung uh ah thupha hong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa na Pathian ii thu ni in, ama thupiak theampo na seam uh le, ama kamciamsa bangin ama mihing hong suaksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaciang leitung mihingte theampo in note Topa ii a teal ama mihingte na hi uh hunlam hong mu tu uh a, hong kiita tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“ Topa in no tungah hong piak tu in na taanghpupite tungah a kamciamsa ngam sungah ta tam mama, nganno tam mama, le an tam mama hong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in a na kholna van pan a hun zui in nguatui hong zusak tu a, na na sepna theampo uh thupha hong pia tu hi, tua hile note in minam tam mama te tungah sum na pukthaak tu uh a, ahizong kuama tung pan sum na pu buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa na Pathian in minamte sungah lampui hong suaksak tu a, ngual nungzui na hi buatu hi; tuni in kong piak ama thupiak theampo thumaan takin na zui uh le note na nuamsa tawntung tu uh a, na kiamsuk ngei buatu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bangbang po ahizong hi thupiakte na nial ngei buatu uh a, a dang pathiante bia in a na na seam ngei buahet tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Ahizong tuni in kong piak Topa na Pathian ii hong thupiak theampo le thukham theampo thumaan takin zui ngawlin ama thu na ni bua uh le, hi siatna theampo note tungah hong tung tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“ Topa in na khuate le na lote haamsiat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa in na lo ante le tuate sung pan na vawt uh ante haamsiat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“ Topa in ta tawm bek a nei tu, an a zawng tu, le khui le tuu tawm bek a nei tu in note hong haamsiat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“ Topa in na sep na vawt theampo haamsiat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“A sia vawtin Topa na nial uh le, manlang takin na lalcip uh dong ama in tuasiatna, buaina le na sepna theampo ah ngimnate tungsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama in na laak tu ngam sungah khat zongh na taan nawn ngawl uh dongin natna khat zawkciang khat hong tungsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa in a kilaw thei natnate, citum le cisa natnate no tungah hong tungsak tu hi; ama in na lo ante a lalsak tu in nguatui kangsak a, vuisa vasak tu hi. Hi bang tuasiatnate na thi dong thuak tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nguazu ngawl tu a, na leitangte thik bangin sak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na lalcip siat uh dong Topa in nguatui taangin leivui le senneal vuipite hong puak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“ Topa in na ngalte in hong zosak tu hi. Note in mun khat pan na sim tu uh a, ahizong mun theampo ah na tai tu uh hi, note tungah thupiangte a mu uh ciang leitung mihingte theampo lau mama tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na thi uh ciang vacimte le ngamsate hong pai in hong ne tu uh a, tuate a beng tu kuama om ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Topa in Egypt te tungah a tunsak bangma in note uilut hong veisak tu hi. Ama in na pumpite matum veisak tu hi. Cithak natna vei in thak na sa tu uh a, ahizong dam thei ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Topa in na thin hong kiamcipsak tu a; mittaw lungmangin hong buaisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mittaw bangin sun lai in na zawt tu a, na lampi na mu thei buatu uh hi. Na sepna pawpo ah na maa uh a vang buatu hi. Note hong kinengcip in hong kisuttol tawntung tu a, hong hu tu kuama om ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Zi tu in ngaknu khat doksa in na koi tu a — ahizong midang khat in ama teenpui tu hi. Inn khat na sa tu a — ahizong a sungah na teang ngei buatu hi. Sapit na ciing tu a — ahizong a nga na ne ngei buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Na khui sia na mu tangin kingo tu a, ahizong a sa bangma na ne buatu hi. Na laa sia na mu tangin kikai tu a, hong kipia kik nawn ngawl tu hi. Na tuu sia na ngalte tungah kipia tu a, hong hu tu kuama om ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Na tapate le na tanute na mu tangin ngamdang mite tungah salin kipia tu hi. Na tate hong cia kik tu en in ni simin na mit zung na liang ahihang a luithawthong hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Haksa takin na ciin sa lo ante ngamdang minam khat in hong laksak tu a, bangma nga ngawlin nencipna le vawtsiatna bek na thuak tawntung tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Na thuaknate in na thin hong kiamcipsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Topa in na peangte a dam thei ngawl, a bot mama meimate dimsak tu hi; na lu pan na peang dong uilut dimsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“ Topa in nangma le na kumpipa sia nangma le na taanghpupite ii a teen ngeingawlna ngamdang ah hong paipui tu hi; tua munah thing le suang taw a kivawt pathiante ii na, na seam tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Topa ii hong thethaang natu ngam tuatuam ah note tungah thupiangte hangin mihingte in lamdang sa tu uh hi; amate in note hong nunau in hong ciammui vawt tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />“Thaici tam mama na ciing tu hi, ahizong tawm bek na la tu uh hi, banghang ziam cile na lo ante sia khaumawte in ne tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Sapitkung ciingin na pua tu a, ahizong na sapitnga lo ngawlin, sapittui na ne buatu uh hi, banghang ziam cile lungte in sapitkungte ne tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Na ngamsung theampo ah olive kungte na ciing tu uh hi, ahizong olive thau peuma na nei buatu uh hi, banghang ziam cile a ngate pul siat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tapate le tanute na nei tu uh hi, ahizong no aa hi ngawl tu hi, banghang ziam cile amate in ngalmat thuak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Na thingkungte le na ankungte theampo lung in netum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />“Na ngam sungah a teang ngamdangmite in vaang nei vaial tu a, note na hi uh le dadamin na vaang bo tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Amate in no hong pukthaak tu sum nei tu a, ahihang note in na pukthaak tu sum bangma na nei buatu uh hi. A khakbel ciang amate in no hong uk tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />“ Topa na Pathian thu ni ngawlin hong piak thukham theampo na zui ngawl hu in, hi tuasiatna teng no tungah hong tung tu a, na lal siat uh dong tuasiatnate hong om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tuate nangma le na suan na paalte tungah a tawntungin Pathian ii thukhenna tetti hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Topa in a nanam in thupha hong pia hi, ahizong lungdam, lungnuam in ama na na seam bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tua ahikom, Topa ii note kungah hong paisak tu ngalte ii na, na seam tu uh hi. Na theampo kitaangsamh in — ngilkial dangtaak le pumnguakin na om tu uh hi. Na lal siat uh dong Topa in nasia takin hong nengniam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Topa in no hong langpan tu in a kampau na heak ngawl uh minam khat leimong panin hong puak tu hi. Muvanlai khat bangin amate in no hong man tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Amate ngongtat tu a, khangmoi, khanghaam, a kuama po hesuak ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Amate in na ngannote le na lo ante hong neaksak tu a, na pukthi tu uh hi. Amate in note atu in antang, sapittui, olive thau, khui ahibuale tuu hong nusiat ngawl tu a; na thi tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Amate in Topa na Pathian ii no hong piak tu ngamsung khua theampo sim tu a, na muan na suan luphung saangte cimhtham tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />“Na ngalte in na khuapite hong uumci ciang anneak tu cimaw in Topa na Pathian ii hong piak na tate sa ngawngawn na ne tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Nampi suan miphabel pa ngawngawn zongh ngalte ii hong uumci laitak cimaw mama tu a, neak tu dang om ngawl ahikom a tate pawlkhat ii sa ne tu hi. Ama in a tate sa sia a suapuipa, a it a zi, a taanglai a tate khat zongh hawm ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />A hau lei hu in a peang in a vak ngeingawl nampi suan numei phabel ngawngawn zongh in tuabang ma in ngamta tu hi. Ngalte in a khua a uumci ciang anneak tu cimaw mama ahikom, a suak tung le a suaksa a nausente sa zongh ama in ne ku tu hi. Ama in a it a pasal le a tanote khat zongh hawm ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />“Hi thubu sungah a ki at Pathian ii hong hilciannate theampo thumaan takin ni ngawlin a lamdang a kiitakhuai Topa na Pathian ii min na zatak vawt bua uh le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />ama in na suan na paalte tungah a dam thei ngawl natnate le a kikhaam zo ngeingawl a lauhuai a kilaw thei natnate tungsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Egypt ah noma thuaksa a lauhuai natnate theampo ama in khatvei hong tungsak kik tu a, na dam kik ngei buatu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Hi Pathian thukhamte le kihilnate tepteena thubu sungah a kison ngawl natna namcin le a kilaw thei natnate zongh ama in tungsak tu a, na mong tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Van ah aksi za in tam napi, Topa na Pathian thu na nit ngawl hu in, tawm bek nungta tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Note hong lapsaang na le hong punsak na thu ah Topa a lungkim bangma in, note hong mot natu le hong lalsak natu thu zongh ah ama lungkim veve tu hi. Na laak tu uh ngam pan note hong kilongkeak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />“ Topa in note sia leimong khat pan mong khat dong, minamte theampo sungah hong thethaang tu a, tualai ah noma le na taanghpupite ii biak ngeingawl pathiante, thing le suang taw a kivawt pathiante na, na seam tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Koima ah thinnopna na mu buatu a, noma ngam ci tu in mun khat zongh na nei buatu uh hi; Topa in no sia thinngimna, lam et nei ngawlna le thinkiamna taw hong khuplup tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Na nuntakna uh lauhuai tawntung tu hi. Sun le zan in na patau tawntung tu uh a, thi tu lau in na nungta tawntung tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Na mu theampo in na thin uh lausak tu hi. Zing simin nitak na thangai tu uh a, nitak simin zingsang na thangai tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Ama in tua munah na pai kik ngei nawn buatu uh hi, hong cisa hikale Topa in teambawte taw Egypt ah hong puak kik tu hi. Tua munah sila in na ngalte tungah noma le noma na kizuak tu uh a, ahizong kuama in no hong lei nuam buatu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hite sia Moab ngam ah Israel mite taw a vawt tu thuciamna taw kisai in, Topa ii Moses tungah a sawl thute ahi hi; hi thuciamna theampo sia Topa ii amate taw Sinai Mual ah a vawt thuciamna belapna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Moses in Israel mite theampo sam khawmin amate tungah, “ Topa ii Egypt kumpipa, a uliante tung le a ngam bup ah a vawt nate noma ma in mu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A lauhuai natnate, nalamdang laknate le Topa ii a vawt a lamdang thuliante mu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahizong na sinsa thute tuni dong mama in ama in no hong telthiangsak ngawl lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kum sawmli tawntung Topa in sennealngam hong kaanpui a, ahizong na puansilhte le na peangdapte uh sia ngeingawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Neak tu in anluum, dawn tu in sapittui ahibuale beer nei ngawl nu hi, ahizong ama sia na Pathian a hina thu hong hil nopna in na kisap bangin Topa in hong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaciang hi mun ih thet ciang ei hong sim tu in Heshbon kumpipa Sihon le Bashan kumpipa Og te hong pai hi. Ahizong eite in amate ih zo a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />a ngam la in, Reuben nam, Gad nam le Manasseh nam a lang teng nga tu in kihawmsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na sep na vawt theampo na zaw natu in hi thuciam sungah a om theampo thumaan takin zui vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Tuni in note theampo — na lampuite le na uliante, na pasalte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />nupite, patangte le no atu in thing hong tomsak, tui hong toaisak a, note sungah a teang ngamdangmite taw Topa na Pathian mai ah na ding siat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hi lai ah tuni in Topa na Pathian ii no taw a vawt hi thuciamna sungah a tum tu le, tuasia taw kisai sep tu te a saang tu in na om uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tuasia ciangin, note le na taanghpupite ahi, Abraham, Isaac, le Jacob tungah a kamciamsa bangin Topa in no ama mi na hina uh le ama note Pathian a hina kipsak thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hi thuciamna le sep tu te sia note taw bekin Topa ii a vawt hi ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuni in ama mai ah a ding eite theampo le a suak ngawl lai ih suan ih paalte taw zong ama in hi thuciamnate a vawt ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Note in Egypt ah nuntakzia le minam dangte ngam sungah khualhawzia na phawk uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thing, suang, ngunn le khamh taw a kivawt a kiihuai a milimte na mu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuni in hi lai ah a ding, pa, numei, innkuan ahibuale minamte, kuama in Topa ih Pathian nungngat in minam dangte ii pathiante bia peuma heak vun. Hisia in a khaa le ngu a nei thingkung a hinna a zung khat taw kibang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuni in hi lai ah a ciliaphuai hong nget tangkalnate za napi a thinpui in keima uuk bang pai leng ka ma vang tu zam a ci omsak peuma heak vun. Tuasia in note theampo a pha, a sia a kibangin hong lalsak siat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa in tuabang mihing khat ii mawna maisak ngawl tu hi. Tua luangin Topa thin uukna sia tua pa atu in meileng bang hi tu a, Topa in ama a lalsak mateng in hi thubu sungah a ki at tuasiatnate theampo tung tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa in ama Israel nam theampo mai ah teengatna khatin nei tu a, Topa ii hilcianna thubu sungah a ki at ahi, thuciamna ah a kikoi haamsiatna theampo taw kizui in tuasiatna tungsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Mailam khang kikte sungah na suan na paalte le ngam khuala pan ngamdangmite in na ngam sungah Topa ii hong puak tuasiatnate le ngim thuaknate mu tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na lote kolh siat tu a, kaan le ci taw kidim tu hi; bangma kiciing thei ngawl tu a, lopa ngawngawn po ngawl tu hi. Na ngam uh sia, Topa ii a thinso lai in a lalcipsak Sodom le Gomorrah, Admah le Zeboiim khuapite taw kibang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuasia ciang leitung buppi in, ‘Banghang Topa in amate ngam hi bang vawt ziam? Bang thu hangin Topa a thin uuk ziam?’ ci in dongh tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuaciang, ‘A taanghpupite ii Pathian in Egypt ngam pan a pusuapui lai in amate taw a vawt thuciamna sia Topa ii mite in a palsat hang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Topa ii a biak ngawl tu in a khaam pathiante, nidang a biak ngeingawl pathian dangte ii na seam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ahikom Topa in a mite tungah thin uuk in, hi thubu sungah a ki at tuasiatnate theampo amate ngam sungah tungsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Topa thin uuk mama a, a thin uukna lian ahikom a ngamsung pan longhkeak in ngamdang denna in nei a, tuni dongin tua munah amate om uh hi,’ ci sia a kizo kikna hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“ Topa ih Pathian ii a kep tuam thuku pawlkhat om hi; ahizong ama in a Thukham hong pualaak zo a, eite le ih suan ih paalte in tuasia a tawntungin a zui tute ih hi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Tu in note thupha le haamsiatna khat sasang na teal tu in kong pia zo hi. Hi thu theampo note tungah hong pian zawkciang le Topa na Pathian ii hong thethaang na mun minamte sungah na teen uh ciang, na teal tu in kong piak sia na phawk kik tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Note le na suan na paalte in Topa kungah heak kikin, tuni a kong piak ama thupiakte na thin theampo taw na zui uh le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa na Pathian in no hong hesuak tu hi. Ama in note hong thethaang na ngamte pan hong pui kik tu a, hong nuamsasak kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A khualabel leimong tengah na kithethaang keak uh zongin Topa na Pathian in note hong kaikhawm in hong pui kik tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />khatvei lai na taanghpupite ii teenna ngam le lei na nga kik tu uh hi. Tuaciang ama in na taanghpupite om ngei bang sangin a nuamsa zaw le a pung zaw in hong siam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na thin theampo taw ama na it natu uh le tua ngam ah na teen suak thei natu uh in Topa na Pathian in note le na suan na paalte tungah thu nit nopna thin hong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in no hong ngaimaw le hong nengniam na ngalte tungah hi haamsiatna theampo tungsak tu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tuni in kong piak ama thupiakte theampo na keamcing tu uh a, ama thu na ni kik tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na nasepna theampo ah Topa in hong nuamsasak tu a; ta tam le nganno tam mama nei in, na lote pan an tam tatak piang tu hi. Na taanghpupite bangma in no zong a nuamsa in hong siam tu sia ama lungdam tu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />ahizong ama hilciannate a kikhumna hi thubu sungah a ki at a thukham theampo zui in a thu na nit uh kul tu hi. Note in na thinsung theampo uh taw ama na zot uh kul tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Tuni kong thupiak sia haksa lei ngawl a, zui laak tu zongh hi ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuasia van ah a om hi ngawl hi. ‘Eite zaak thei tu le zui thei tu in akua kaato in tua thu hong puaksuk tu ziam?’ ci in kidok kul ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuipi ngalkhat ah a om thu zongh hi ngawl hi. ‘Eite zaak thei tu le ih zui thei tu in akua in tuipi kaantan in ei kungah hong paipui tu ziam’ ci in dok kul ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuabang hi ngawl hi, hi lai ah note taw omkhawm hi. Note in na he uh a, zongh, na son kaak thei uh hi, tua ahiciang tu in zui vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Tuni in a pha le a sia, nuntakna le thina khat sasang na teal tu kong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuni in kong piak Topa na Pathian ii thupiakte na zui uh le, tuaciang ama it in, a thu ni in a thukham theampo na zui uh le, note na nuamsa tu uh a, a pung minam khat na suak tu uh hi. Note laak tu ngam ah Topa na Pathian in thupha hong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahizong a thu ni ngawl nangai ngawlin, pathian dangte a bia tu in lam na pial uh le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />tu in hi lai ah kidop natu in kong son hi — note hong kilalcipsak siat tu hi. Na laak tu uh ngam, Jordan ngun ngalkhat ah khuangei nungta ngawl tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tu in khat sasang na teal tu uh nuntakna le thina, Pathian ii thupha le Pathian ii haamsiatna kong pia a, na teal uh sia hong heakpui tu in vantung le leitung ka ko hi. Nuntakna teal vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa na Pathian it vun, a thu ni vun, ama tungah thumaan vun, tuasia ciang, na taanghpupite ahi Abraham, Isaac, le Jacob tungah piak tu a, a kamciamna ngam sungah noma le na suan na paalte khansau in na nungta tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Moses in Israel mite tungah a thuson zom lai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tu in kum za le kum kul ka pha a, note ii lampui hi zo nawn ngawl tu khi hi. Tua bek dom ngawlin Topa in Jordan ngun kan ngawl tu ni hi, hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate ngam na laak thei natu uh in Topa na Pathian ama mama na mai uh ah pai tu a, tua ngam ah a teang minamte lalcipsak tu hi; Tuaciang Topa ci sa bangin Joshua sia note lampui hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa in Amor kumpipate ahi Sihon le Og zo in, a ngam a lalcipsak bangma in tua mite lalcipsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in amate hong zosak tu a, kong sonsa bang linlian in amate na vawt tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na thin khosak vun a, kimuang vun. Amate kiita heak vun. Na Pathian, Topa ama mama in note hong ompui tu hi. Ama in note hong lelsak ngawl tu a, hong taisan ngawl tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaciang Moses in Joshua sam a, Israel mite theampo ii mai ama tungah, “Na thin khosak in a, kimuang in; a taanghpupite tungah Topa kamciam omsa ngam a la tu hi mite a lampui tu sia nangma ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa ama mama in nangma lam hong pui in, hong ompui tu hi. Ama in nang hong nusia ngawl tu a, hong taisan ngawl tu hi, tua ahiciang thinno heak in a, lau heak in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaciang Moses in Pathian Thukham at in, Topa Thuciamna Thingkuang a keam Levi thiampite le Israel lampuite tungah pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Moses in amate thupia a, “Kum sali a cin sim, leiba maisak kum hong thet ciang Buk Poai ah hisia a ngingin sim vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Biakna mun khat sia ah Israel mite Topa na Pathian bia tu in hong pai uh ciang hi thukham sia amate tungah sim vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A kuama po in hisia za thei a, Topa na Pathian a zatak vawt thei natu le ama ii thuhilte thumaan takin a zui thei natu in pa, numei, patang te le noma khuate ah a teang ngamdangmite a vekpi in sam khawm vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa na Pathian ii Thukham a za ngeingawl na suan na paalte in hi bangin za tu uh hi. Tuasia ciang Jordan ngun ngalkhat na laak tu ngam sungah a teen laiteng ama thu a nit thei natu in amate in sin tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaciang Topa in Moses tungah, “Khuangei nungta nawn ngawl tu ni hi. Keima in Joshua thu ka hil thei natu in ama samin Puanbuk ah hong paipui ta'n,” ci hi. Moses le Joshua Puanbuk ah pai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tualai Puanbuk kongbiang ah meeikhuam khat sung pan amate tungah Topa hong kilangh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah, “Thi pal tu ni hi, na thi zawkciang mihingte kei tungah hong thumaan ngawl tu a, amate taw ka vawt thuciamna sia palsat tu uh hi. Amate in kei hong taisan tu a, a tum natu ngamsung doai biate ii pathiante bia tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuabang teng a pian ciang amate tungah ka thin uuk tu hi; amate ka taisan tu a, amate kimon tu hi. A lauhuai natna tuatuamte amate tungah theng tu hi, tuasia ciang keima a Pathian sia amate taw omkhawm nawn ngawl ka hikom hi thu teng piang hi cisia amate in tel tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuasia hun ciang amate ka hu buatu hi, banghang ziam cile amate a sia in ngamta zo a, pathian dangte bia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Tu in, la hisia at in. Amate langpanna tetti ahi natu in la hisia Israel mihingte hil in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A taanghpupite tungah ka kamciamsa bangin hi ngampha le ngamnuam ah amate ka pui tu hi. Tualai ah amate du an theampo nei tu uh a, nuam takin teang tu uh hi. Ahizong amate in hong nungngat in pathian dangte bia tu uh hi. Amate in kei hong nial tu a, ka thuciam palsat tu uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />tuaciang, a lauhuai natna tuatuamte amate tungah tung tu hi. Ahizong hi la kisa lai tu a, tuasia in amate a kilangpanna tetti hi tu hi. Tu laitak amate piak tu in ka khapsa ngam ah ka tumpui ma ngawngawn in amate ngaisutna ka he hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ni ma in Moses in tua la at a, Israel mite hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Topa in Nun tapa Joshua a paupuina sungah, “Kimuang in a, na thin khosak in. Ka khapsa ngam sungah Israel mite lam na pui tu a, nangma taw kong omkhawm tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Moses in laibu khat sungah Pathian Thukham at a, khat zongh a kheet ngawl natu in kidawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A man zawkciang, Topa Thuciamna Thingkuang a keam Levi thiampite tungah ama in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Pathian ii Thukham hi thubu sia la vun a, ama mite langkhat ah tetti in tua munah a om top thei natu in Topa na Pathian ii Thuciamna Thingkuang hui ah koi vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amate bang zata thinpui in bangbang hong langpan nuam cisia ka he hi. Ka nuntak sungin amate in Topa sia hi zata langpan ahile ka thi zawkciang langpan seseam tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hi thute amate tungah ka son thei natu in na nam lampuite le uliante a vekpi in ka mai ah khawmtua vun; Amate langkhat ah ka tetti tu in vantung le leitung ka ko tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka thi zawkciang, amate ka hil sa thute a nial mi seksol a sua tu sia ka he hi. Amate in Topa ii a khaamte a vawtna taw in ama thin uuksak ahi hu in mai sangah tuasiatna thuak tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuaciang Moses in a nuai a la teng theampo suut a, Israel mite theampo in ngai uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Van le lei awng, ka kammalte za vun a, ka ci teng hong ngai cinten tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kong hilcianna nguamal bangin taak tu a, leitung ah daaitui kia bang hi tu hi. Ka kammalte sia thingkungnote tungah nguamal phiin bangin lopa moite tungah dam takin a zu nguatui bangin taak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa min ka pok tu a, a mite in a letna son tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“ Topa sia note hong dal a hatbelpa hi a, A sepzia theampo kicing in maan hi; Na Pathian thumaan in thutak a; Ama in a maan le a pha in seam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahizong note sia thumaan ngawlin ama ii mi tu in na citaak bua uh a, mawnei le a ngualtheam thei minam na hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A mawmaw, khuangaisut nei ngawl mite awng, hi bangin Topa vawt tu nu ziam? Ama sia no hong Bitphua pa, na pa uh hi a, minam khatin hong vawt pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“A bosa hunte, nidang lai hunte, ngaisun tavun; Thupiangte hong son tu in na pate dongh tavun, a bosa thute son tu in khanghaamte dongh tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A Saangbel Pa in minamte a ngam a lei tu pia a; mite teen natu mun khensatsak hi. Ama in minam simin vantung mi khat tek pia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />ahizong Jacob suan le paalte sia ama atu in teal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Ama in a ngamtongta vuipi vakna duisung ngampa sennealngam sungah amate vakkotna mu hi. Ama in ama le ama a kikep bangin amate keamcing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Muvanlai in a note len tu sinpui a, manin a kiphal thakhuite tungah bit tak a koi bangin, Topa in Israel te a taak natu pan keamcing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa bek in ama mite lampui a, ngamdang pathian khat ii huna kihel ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“ Topa in amate mualtung munte uksak a, amate in lo pan a piangte ne uh hi. Amate in suang kawmah khuaitui mu uh a, suanghol lei sungah a olive kungte limci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A khuipuite le a kealpuite in noai tam tatak ma pia a, amate in tuu, keal le khui phabel, zungtaang phabel le sapittui deitealte nei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“ Topa ii mite hau uh a, ahizong Topa leedo uh hi; amate an khamin thau uh hi. Amate in a Bitphuapa Pathian taisan uh a, a vaanglian hunpa nial uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A milim biakna Topa in ensan a; a pha ngawl a sepna in Topa thin uuksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate in pathian tatak ahi ngawl pathiante, a taanghpupite ii a heak ngawl pathian thakte Israel te ii a thu a nit ngeingawl pathiante tungah sangaw biakpiakna vawt uh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate in a vaanglian ngumpa, amate nuntakna a pia pa, a Pathian mangil uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Hi thu teng Topa in a mu ciang a thin uuk a, a tapate le a tanute nial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />‘Amate ka hu nawn buatu hi,’ ama in ci hi; ‘tuasia ciang a thinpuite le a thumaan ngawl mite tungah bang piang ziam ka en tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amate in a milimte taw ka thin hong uuksak a, Pathian tatak a hi ngawlte amate ii pathian a ci uhte taw ka etsat natu hong vawt uh hi. Tua ahikom amate thin a uuksak tu in minam a kici thawthong khat ka zangh tu hi; a mawmaw minam khat in amate ka ensansak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka thin uukna sia mei bangin kuang a, leitung a om na theampo kaangh siat tu hi. Leinuai dong thengsuk tu a, mualpeangte zongh kaanghtum siat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“‘Keima in amate tungah a bo thei ngawl tuasiatnate ka tungsak tu a, ka thaltang theampo taw amate ka kap tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amate ngilkial le cisa natna taw thi tu a; a lauhuai natnate taw thi tu uh hi. Ngamsa ngilote in amate ka simsak tu a, ngul ngu neite in ka tusak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ngalpi hangin amate lam lai ah thi tu uh a; a bangkua uh sungah patauna tung tu hi. Tangvalno le ngaknuno te thi tu uh a; nausente le khanghaamte zongh kikhoaikhe ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Keima in amate ka mon siat tu a, tua hile kuama in amate ciamtee ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahizong amate a hualcip pa keima ma ka hi ciang a ngalte in ka mite a zawna thu sia kiphatsakna in ka neisak thei buatu hi,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Israel sia khua ngaisutna nei ngawl minam khat hi a; ciimna bangma nei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Amate in a ngallelna ii ahang sia mu ngawl a; thupiangte tel zo ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Banghangin mi khat in tulkhat zo a, mi nii bek in tulsawm zo thei ziam? Topa a Pathian in amate nusia zo hi; a thahat Pathian in amate koithong zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A ngalte in amate ii pathiante thazawm a, a thahat Israel te ii Pathian taw a kiban ngawlna thu he uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A ngalte Sodom le Gomorrah bangin tatsia a, a ngate khaa in ngu a nei sapitkungte taw kibangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />sapittui sia ngulngu taw vawt bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“ Topa in a ngalte ii vawtna teng ciamtee a; daan a piak hun tu ngak nginge hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Topa in amate phula in daan pia tu a; a kiamsuk tu hun hong pai tu a; a lal tu ni nai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A thahatna teng a bo a mu ciang Topa in a mite suatak tu hi. Ama in a naseamte a panpui tu a om ngawl hunlam a mu ciang, ama na a seamte hesuak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Topa in a mite tungah, ‘Na suan na muan tua a thahat pathiante koisungah om ziam’ ci in dongh tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Noma in na sangaw biakpiakna sathau taw amate na vaak uh a, a neak tu in sapittui na pia uh hi. Tu in amate hong hu tu in paisak vun. Noma hong suatak tu in delsak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />“ ‘Keima, keima bekma Pathian ka hi hi; pathian tatak a dang om ngawl hi. Ka thatlum a, nuntakna ka pia hi, ka liamsak a, ka damsak hi, ka nasepte kuama in hong nalh thei ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Keima in a nungta Pathian ka hi takpi bangma in, ka khut laamin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />a tee vazal ka namsau ka taat tu a, thutang khenna ka musak tu hi, ci in ka kiciam hi. Ka ngalte tungah phu ka la tu a, keima hong ngaimawte daan ka pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ka thaltangte amate chi sungah kidia tu a, ka namsau in kei hong nalh theampo that tu hi. Kei hong dote kuama ka khoaikhe buatu a; a liamte le thongtaakte ngawngawn thi tu uh hi.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />“Minamte awng Topa ii mite pok hamtang tu nu hi — ama in ama ii mite a thatte theampo daan pia hi. Ama in a ngalte phula a, a mite mawnate maisak hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Moses le Nun tapa Joshua in Israel mite zaak thei tu in, hi la suut uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Moses in mite tungah Pathian ii hilnate a son zawkciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />ama in, “Tuni in kong piak thupiakte theampo zui hamtang vun. Pathian ii hilnate theampo thumaan takin a zui thei natu in na tate tungah son kikik vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Hi hilnate kammal thawthong hi ngawl a; na nuntakna tatak uh ahi hi. Tuate zui vun, tua hile na laak tu uh Jordan ngalkhat ngam ah khansau in na nungta tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tua ni ma in Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />“Jericho khuapi ii langkhat a om Moab te ngamsung Abarim Mual te ah pai in a, Nebo Mual tungah kaato in, Israel mite ka piak tu Canaan leitang en in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Na suapuipa Aaron ii Hor Mual tungah a thi bangin tua mual tungah na thi tu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />banghang ziam cile note ngeal in Israel mite mai ah keima hong melsia in nong thumaan bua uh hi. Zin ngampa sung Kadesh khua nai tui omna Meribah ah na om uh lai in, mite mai ah kei nong zatak vawt bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tua ngam sia na ngal et tu a, ahizong Israel mite ka piak tu ngam sungah na tum buatu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hite sia Pathian ii teal pa Moses in a thi ma in Israel mite tungah a thansak thuphate ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sinai Mual pan Topa hong pai a; Edom ngam tungah ni bangin suak in, Paran Mual pan a mite tungah taang hi. Vantunglalangte tulsawm ama taw omkhawm a, a ziatsang khut taw meikuang khat toai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa in a mite it a, ama ii neisa mite sungsia hi. Tua ahikom, eite a peang ah kunin ama thupiakte ih zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ih minam ii neisa a manphabel Moses ii hong piaksa thukham ih zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua nam teng le a lampuite a kikaikhop ciang, Topa sia ama ii Israel mite kumpi suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Moses in Reuben nam huvau hi bangin ci hi: “A mite a tawm hangin Reuben nam mong ngei heak hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in Judah nam huvau hi bangin ci hi: “ Topa awng, amate ii hu hong ngetna aw ngai in; Nam dangte taw ngawm khawm kik in. Topa awng, amate atu ngaldosak in. Tuaciang a ngalte ii a sim ciang amate hu in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in Levi nam huvau hi bangin ci hi: “ Topa awng, nangma deina sia Urim le Thummim taw pualaak in. A thumaan na Levi naseamte tungtawnin pualaak in; Massah ah amate na ze et a Meribah tui ah amate ii a maanna thu na lak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate in nangma tungah a nute a pate, a suapui pate le a tate tung sangin a lian zaw thumaan na lak hi. Amate in na thupiakte ni in, na thuciam tungah thumaan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in na thukham a zui thei natu in na mite hil tu hi; Na biaknatau tungah sangaw biakpiaknate pia tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa awng, amate nam ii a thahat natu in hu in; A nasepna ah lungkim in. A ngalte theampo hualcip in; tuate tho kiksak ngei heak in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in Benjamin nam huvau hi bangin ci hi: “Hite Topa ii it le a kepcing nam ahi hi. Ama in sunkhuateakin amate cing a, tuaciang amate sungah ama teang hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in Joseph nam huvau hi bangin ci hi: “ Topa in a ngam a lei sia nguatui le leinuai tui taw thupha pia tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A ngam a lei in thupha nga hen a, ni taw a min thingngate le khuahun zui in a nga thingnga phabelte taw kidim tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A taanghtawng mualte sia deiteal thingngate taw kidim tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A ngam a lei sia napha theampo taw kidim hen a, Sawlpaang kuang sung pan a pau Topa ii phatna taw thupha nga tahen. Hi thuphate Joseph ii nam tungah tung tahen, Banghang ziam cile ama sia a suapuipate sungah lampui ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Joseph in khuital khat ii thahatna nei a, Ngam khuital kiite nei hi. Ama kiite sia Manasseh mi a tul a tul le Ephraim mi tulsawmte ahi hi. Tuate taw minamte sii a, leimong dongah nawk hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in Zebulun le Issachar minamte huvau hi bangin ci hi: “Zelubun sia tuipi tungah sum vawtna taw nuamsa tahen a, Issachar ii hauna sia inn sungah khang tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate in a mual tungah ngamdang mite sam a, tualai ah a maan sangaw biakpiaknate pia hi. Amate in a hauna sia tuipi pan le tuipi hui sen panin nga uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in Gad nam huvau hi bangin ci hi: “Amate ngam a zaisak pa Pathian pok vun. Gad in tawpi khat bangin a lu a baan khat balkeak tu in pang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amate in amate atu in ngam phabelna mun la tu hi; Lampui khat ii tel amate kipia hi. Israel lampuite a kikaikhop tek ciang, amate in Topa ii thupiakte le thukhamte zui uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama in Dan nam huvau hi bangin ci hi: “Dan sia tawpi no khat ahi hi; Ama sia Bashan panin leang hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama in Naphtali nam huvau hi bangin ci hi: “Naphtali sia Topa ii maipha nga in nasia takin thupha kipia hi, A ngam sia Galilee tuili pan thangsang dong thengsuk hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama in Asher nam huvau hi bangin ci hi: “Asher sia nam dangte sangin thupha kipia zaw hi. Ama a suapuipate ii diksakbel hi hen a, a ngam olive kungte taw kidim tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A khuate thik kongpite taw kidal hen a, Ngammuang in nungta tawntung tahen,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Israel mite awng, noma hong hu tu in meei tungah a to, a vaangletna taw van kaantan in a pai Noma ii Pathian taw a kibang pathian peuma om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pathian in note hong dal tawntung zo a; A tawntung a om ama ii khutte in no hong panpui hi. Ama in maisang na manaw kawkawmin na ngalte notkeak a, Amate a mon tu in no hong sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuabangin Jacob suan le paalte van pan a taak daaitui ii a kawtsakna mun, an le sapittui taw a kidimna ngamah ngammuang thinnuam in teang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Israel awng, bangza in lungdam nu ziam! Topa ii a ngup note taw kibang minam khat zongh om ngawl hi. Topa ama mama na lum le na namsau hi a, note hong dal tu le zawna hong pia tu ahi hi. Na ngalte in hesuak ngenin hong pai tu a, tuaciang amate na tuanhcil tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Moses sia Moab zaangtam pan Nebo Mual, Jericho nisuana sang Pisgah Mual dawn ah paito a, tualai ah Topa in ngam le lei buppi lak hi: Gilead ngam saksang Dan khua dong;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Naphtali ngam bup, Ephraim le Manasseh ngam teng; Judah ngam nitumna sang ah Mediterranean tuipi dong;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Judah ngamkhen thangsang; tuaciang Zoar zaangtam panin palm pona khuapi Jericho dong zaangtam teng lak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Topa in Moses tungah, “Hi ngam le lei sia a suan a paalte tungah piak tu in Abraham, Isaac, le Jacob tungah ka kamciamsa ahi hi. Nang kong musak zo a, ahizong tua munah kong paisak buatu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Topa ii naseampa Moses sia, Topa ii a cisa bangin tua mun Moab ngam sungah thi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa in Moses sia Bethpeor khua langkhat, Moab kuam sungah phum a, ahizong tuni dongin ama a kiphumna mun san tatak kuama in he ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Moses sia kum za le kum kul a phak ciang thi a; a tha a ngal zongh a hat ngei za ma in hat lai in, a mit khua muna zongh pha lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel mite Moab zaangtam ah ama atu in ni sawmthum sung khuangai in om uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nun tapa Joshua sia ciimna taw kidim hi, banghang ziam cile Moses in ama zalaih tu in koi zo hi. Israel mite in Joshua thu ni a, Topa ii Moses tungtawnin a thupiakte zui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in ama taw maitang kisi in paupui hi. Moses bang ahi Israel mite sungah kamsaang khat zongh om ngeingawl hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in Moses sawlin Egypt kumpipa, a uliante tung le a ngamsung tengah nalamdang laknate le a lamdangte a vawt bangin a vawt ngei kamsaang dang om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Israel te theampo ii mit mu in Moses ii na lianpi le a lauhuai nate a vawt bangin a vawt thei kamsaang dang om ngawl hi.
  </para>
</usx>
